                        ;

                        background-color: #4c2f92;
                    }</style><div class="c-hero__content-wrapper" data-transparent="false" style="--hero-bg-color:#4c2f92"><div class="c-hero__content"><h2 class="c-hero__title  u-type-sm">Media enquiries</h2><div class="c-hero__text  c-content  u-type-base--small c-hero__text--start"><p>If you are a journalist, please contact our global press office team at <a href="mailto:media@lego.com">media@lego.com</a>.</p>
<p>For all non-journalist enquiries relating to order status, missing bricks or building instructions, please contact <a href="https://www.lego.com/service" target="_blank">customer service</a>.</p>
<p>For enquiries about business opportunities, charity, product ideas or projects and theses, please check our <a href="https://www.lego.com/aboutus/lego-group/contact" target="_blank">contact information</a>.</p>
