,"updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:52.202Z","ACL":{},"_version":7,"display_title":"Products","category_color":"#8952ba","_in_progress":false,"special_category":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:11:46.412Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"bltfc4d64d99f5a2fe3","_version":4,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"category_color":"#00a3da","created_at":"2024-11-07T13:15:50.881Z","created_by":"blt95f972fd032911c0","display_title":"Press Releases","special_category":true,"tags":[],"title":"Press Releases","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:32.213Z","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","publish_details":{"time":"2025-12-19T13:04:40.633Z","user":"blt95f972fd032911c0","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}}],"components":[{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs58ef7f4795a08b75"},"text":" - The LEGO Group reveals a new range of LEGO® *Star Wars*™ sets, including products celebrating the 50-year anniversary of  *Star Wars*. \n - The seven-set collection spans artwork, vehicles, helmets and display models inspired by iconic moments from across the *Star Wars* saga since 1977. \n - Each 50th anniversary set features exclusive LEGO minifigures inspired by original *Star Wars* concept art by Ralph McQuarrie and reimagined collectible *Star Wars* poster tiles. \n - Available from 1 January 2027 via [LEGO.com/Star-Wars][1] and LEGO Stores worldwide.\n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-us/themes/star-wars/about","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt47611b0c3fc08edb","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:14.868Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"31158355","filename":"75467_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg","parent_uid":"blt5658d372b9502e2f","tags":[],"title":"75467_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg","updated_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:14.868Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-12T14:01:30.458Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt47611b0c3fc08edb/75467_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO Star Wars A New Hope Movie Poster"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csd35aaa1703a76286"},"text":"**BILLUND, DENMARK, 12 NOVEMBER 2026:** Today, ahead of the 50th anniversary of *Star Wars* next year, the LEGO Group announces a new wave of seven exciting LEGO® *Star Wars*™ building sets, all available from January 1st, 2027. ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"bltc731a45d20971efc","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:15.419Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"32903687","filename":"75467_Lifestyle_Envr_02.jpg","parent_uid":"blt5658d372b9502e2f","tags":[],"title":"75467_Lifestyle_Envr_02.jpg","updated_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:15.419Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-12T14:01:27.971Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltc731a45d20971efc/75467_Lifestyle_Envr_02.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO Star Wars A New Hope Movie Poster"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csef4cbe4a52e3177f"},"text":"To celebrate half a century since the premiere of *Star Wars*, later names *Star Wars: A New Hope*, fans can recreate one of the saga’s most iconic images with the **LEGO *Star Wars*™ *A New Hope* Movie Poster**. This 3,209-piece display model transforms the original theatrical poster into a striking LEGO brick-built wall art, bringing beloved characters, vehicles and moments from the film to life with impressive 3D detail.\n\nMeasuring at over 59cm/23in high, the build captures Luke Skywalker, Princess Leia, R2-D2 and C-3PO against the backdrop of Darth Vader, the Death Star and the Battle of Yavin. Designed for display, the completed model can be mounted on a wall or leaned against a wall as a tribute to the film that introduced a galaxy, far, far away. The set includes a collectable alternative poster tile, based on *Star Wars: A New Hope*. ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blta2f785d5b4554d92","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:50.969Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"23317888","filename":"75482_Lifestyle_Build.jpg","parent_uid":"blt5658d372b9502e2f","tags":[],"title":"75482_Lifestyle_Build.jpg","updated_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:50.969Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-12T14:01:17.893Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blta2f785d5b4554d92/75482_Lifestyle_Build.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO Star Wars Upscaled Luke Skywalker"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs10f7ffd7a98d2a26"},"text":"The **LEGO *Star Wars*™ Up-Scaled Luke Skywalker** set brings one of cinema’s heroes to life in all its up-scaled minifigure glory. Donning his X-wing pilot uniform and helmet, the 981-piece build features details and poses for fans to explore, with moveable hands, arms, legs and head. The set also includes an exclusive Princess Leia (Concept Art) LEGO minifigure for fans to collect. ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt87633c72b6c515e5","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:08.147Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"2853707","filename":"75478_Prod.png","parent_uid":"blt5658d372b9502e2f","tags":[],"title":"75478_Prod.png","updated_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:08.147Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-12T14:01:34.786Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt87633c72b6c515e5/75478_Prod.png"},"alt":"LEGO Star Wars Y-Wing"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs9323fd70b990f231"},"text":"The **LEGO *Star Wars*™ Rebel Y-Wing Starfighter** brings the Battle of Yavin straight to the living room. Featuring brick-built details and minifigures of fan favourite characters like Mon Mothma, Dutch Vander and his astromech droid R2-BHD, the 676-piece set also includes an exclusive Luke Skywalker (Concept Art) LEGO minifigure, as part of the 50th anniversary celebrations. ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"bltb9001a3275037c5b","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-11-11T21:27:34.943Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"26541615","filename":"75466_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg","parent_uid":"blt5658d372b9502e2f","tags":[],"title":"75466_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg","updated_at":"2026-11-11T21:27:34.943Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-12T14:01:40.400Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltb9001a3275037c5b/75466_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO Star Wars™ Darth Vader 2-In-1 Wall Art"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs6862b1ca927af17f"},"text":"The **LEGO *Star Wars*™ Darth Vader 2-In-1 Wall Art** gives builders two new ways to show their love for one of the galaxy’s most terrifying villains. The 628-piece set allows fans to choose between building Darth Vader’s iconic helmet or his infamous “I am your father” quote, using his red lightsaber as a backdrop. Accompanied by a collectible Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back™ poster tile; the set makes a unique display piece.","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"bltb046ea03dea0338d","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:50.441Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"3158402","filename":"75495_Prod.png","parent_uid":"blt5658d372b9502e2f","tags":[],"title":"75495_Prod.png","updated_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:50.441Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-12T14:01:20.856Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltb046ea03dea0338d/75495_Prod.png"},"alt":"Storm Trooper Helmet"},"video_id":"","video":"","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs3257ff4df65590bf"},"text":"Every story has its beginning. The **LEGO *Star Wars*™ Stormtrooper (Concept Art) Helmet** pays homage to original *Star Wars* concept designs by Ralph McQuarrie which helped inform the visual identity of the *Star Wars* galaxy. The 832-piece display set includes unique details and lets fans explore the original design from all angles. Included is a collectible *Rogue One* poster tile, reimaged with LEGO Minifigures. ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"bltbe7e643a78f2c82f","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:05.042Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"5073970","filename":"75470_Prod.png","parent_uid":"blt5658d372b9502e2f","tags":[],"title":"75470_Prod.png","updated_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:05.042Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-12T14:01:36.996Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltbe7e643a78f2c82f/75470_Prod.png"},"alt":"LEGO Star Wars Mustafar Duel"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csf5bf291330241d10"},"text":"The **LEGO *Star Wars*™ Mustafar Duel** showcases the pivotal moment where Anakin Skywalker confronts his master and friend Obi-Wan Kenobi. Both characters are included in LEGO minifigure form, as well as a brick-built lava landscape and hover pods, letting fans recreate the battle with unique play functions. Containing 372 pieces, the set is accompanied by an exclusive Han Solo (Concept Art) LEGO minifigure. ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt9bde54f183ab5e08","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:27.215Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"20090979","filename":"75480_Lifestyle_Cons.jpg","parent_uid":"blt5658d372b9502e2f","tags":[],"title":"75480_Lifestyle_Cons.jpg","updated_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:27.215Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-12T14:01:25.188Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt9bde54f183ab5e08/75480_Lifestyle_Cons.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO Star Wars™ Duel On Bespin"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csa12be3e4f4aec899"},"text":"The **LEGO *Star Wars*™ Duel On Bespin** brings to life one of cinema’s biggest plot twists. The build faithfully recreates the bridge in Cloud City where Luke Skywalker and Darth Vader confront their fates, with both characters included in LEGO minifigure form. A printed “No, I am your father!” plaque, play functions and an exclusive Darth Vader (Concept Art) LEGO minifigure complete the 718-piece set. \n\n**All products will be available from 1 January 2027 via [LEGO.com/Star-Wars][1] and LEGO Stores worldwide.** \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-us/themes/star-wars/about","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"Notes to Editor","_metadata":{"uid":"cs377c5f24319ba4e3"},"text":"For more information, please contact: [media@LEGO.com][1]. \n\n**Product Details** \n**LEGO® *Star Wars*™ *A New Hope* Movie Poster** \n - Age: 18+ \n - Price: 299,99€ / 299,99$ / 259,99£ \n - Pieces: 3209 \n - Product No.: 75467 \n - Dimensions: Measures over 23 in. (59 cm) high and 16 in. (40 cm) wide \n - Available:  \n - *LEGO Insiders Early Access: 1st January 2027 \n - For all: 4th January 2027\n*LEGO Insiders membership required, T\u0026Cs apply.  \n\n**LEGO® *Star Wars*™ Up-Scaled Luke Skywalker** \n - Age: 10+ \n - Price: 99,99€ / 99,99$ / 89,99£ \n - Pieces: 981 \n - Product No.: 75482 \n - Dimensions: Stands over 10 in. (26 cm) tall \n - Available: 1st January 2027\n\n**LEGO® *Star Wars*™ Rebel Y-Wing Starfighter**\n - Age: 8+ \n - Price: 79,99€ / 79,99$ / 69,99£ \n - Pieces: 676 \n - Product No.: 75478 \n - Dimensions: Measures over 3 in. (7 cm) high, 14.5 in. (37 cm) long and 7 in. (18 cm) wide \n - Available: 1st January 2027\n\n**LEGO® *Star Wars*™ Darth Vader 2-In-1 Wall Art** \n - Age: 18+ \n - Price: 69,99€ / 69,99$ / 59,99£ \n - Pieces: 628 \n - Product No.: 75466 \n - Dimensions: Measures over 10 in. (25 cm) high and 10 in. (25 cm) wide  \n - Available: 1st January 2027\n\n**LEGO® *Star Wars*™ Stormtrooper (Concept Art) Helmet** \n - Age: 18+ \n - Price: 79,99€ / 79,99$ / 69,99£ \n - Pieces: 832 \n - Product No.: 75495 \n - Dimensions: Measures over 7 in. (18 cm) high, 5.5 in. (14 cm) deep and 4.5 in. (12 cm) wide \n - Available: 1st January 2027\n\n**LEGO® *Star Wars*™ Mustafar Duel** \n - Age: 9+ \n - Price: 39,99€ / 39,99$ / 34,99£ \n - Pieces: 372 \n - Product No.: 75470 \n - Dimensions: Measures over 3 in. (8 cm) high, 4.5 in. (12 cm) deep and 8.5 in. (21 cm) wide \n - Available: 1st January 2027\n\n**LEGO® Star Wars™ Duel On Bespin** \n - Age: 9+ \n - Price: 79,99€ / 79,99$ / 69,99£ \n - Pieces: 718 \n - Product No.: 75480 \n - Dimensions: Measures over 9 in. (22 cm) high, 5.5 in. (14 cm) deep and 14.5 in. (36 cm) wide \n - Available: 1st January 2027\n\nSTAR WARS and related properties are trademarks and/or copyrights, in the United States and other countries, of Lucasfilm Ltd. and/or its affiliates. © \u0026 TM Lucasfilm Ltd. \n\n**About the LEGO Group** \nThe LEGO Group’s mission is to inspire and develop the builders of tomorrow through the power of play. The LEGO System in Play, with its foundation in LEGO bricks, allows children and fans to build and rebuild anything they can imagine. \n\nThe LEGO Group was founded in Billund, Denmark in 1932 by Ole Kirk Kristiansen, its name derived from the two Danish words LEg GOdt, which mean “Play Well”. Today, the LEGO Group remains a family-owned company headquartered in Billund. However, its products are now sold in more than 130 countries worldwide. \n\nFor more news from the LEGO Group, information about our financial performance and responsibility engagement, please visit [www.LEGO.com/aboutus][2]. \n\n\n  [1]: mailto:media@LEGO.com\n  [2]: https://www.lego.com/en-us/aboutus","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}}],"created_at":"2026-11-11T21:32:04.229Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","manchet":{"title":"A galaxy built brick by brick: New LEGO® Star Wars™ 7-piece collection revealed for the 50th anniversary of Star Wars™","text":"Ahead of the 50th anniversary of Star Wars next year, the LEGO Group announces a new wave of seven exciting LEGO® Star Wars™ building sets, all available from January 1st, 2027. The seven-set collection spans artwork, vehicles, helmets and display models inspired by iconic moments from across the Star Wars saga since 1977.","image":{"file":{"uid":"blt47611b0c3fc08edb","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:14.868Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"31158355","filename":"75467_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg","parent_uid":"blt5658d372b9502e2f","tags":[],"title":"75467_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg","updated_at":"2026-11-11T21:28:14.868Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-12T14:01:30.458Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt47611b0c3fc08edb/75467_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO Star Wars A New Hope Movie Poster"}},"media_assets":[],"page_headline":"A galaxy built brick by brick: New LEGO® Star Wars™ 7-piece collection revealed for the 50th anniversary of Star Wars™ ","related_articles":["blt190ae90ec74007f9","blt745ff4a1dc189e48","blt159767c534e2b3bb"],"release_date":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","seo_description":"LEGO  new Star Wars™ sets 50 anniversary A New Hope Movie Poster Luke Skywalker Darth Vader Mustafar Duel Bespin","show_social_sharing":true,"spotlight":false,"tags":[],"title":"LEGO Star Wars 50th Anniversary sets","updated_at":"2026-11-12T14:01:32.587Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","url":"/news/2026/november/lego-star-wars-50th-anniversary-sets","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-12T14:01:45.947Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"blt2ee466360ac61c81","_version":20,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"asset_bundle":{"uid":"blt9805e2b12ed488c8","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"application/zip","created_at":"2026-11-04T15:23:52.906Z","created_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","file_size":"152151394","filename":"LEGO_Holiday_Ad_2026.zip","parent_uid":"bltd38c3d14195318cf","tags":[],"title":"LEGO Holiday Ad 2026.zip","updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:23:52.906Z","updated_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-05T09:21:40.955Z","user":"blt84865cd37210c29c","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt9805e2b12ed488c8/LEGO_Holiday_Ad_2026.zip"},"author":"","categories":[{"uid":"bltfc4d64d99f5a2fe3","_version":4,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"category_color":"#00a3da","created_at":"2024-11-07T13:15:50.881Z","created_by":"blt95f972fd032911c0","display_title":"Press Releases","special_category":true,"tags":[],"title":"Press Releases","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:32.213Z","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","publish_details":{"time":"2025-12-19T13:04:40.633Z","user":"blt95f972fd032911c0","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}}],"components":[{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csdbeb84d7a9b5e99a"},"text":" - Directed by Michael Gracey, director of Oscar, Golden Globe and BAFTA nominated films like The Greatest Showman and Better Man, viewers get a sneak peek inside ’The LEGO® Holiday Workshop.' \n - Set to Daft Punk’s iconic hit ‘One More Time’, the ad follows a single LEGO brick on an action-packed journey through the workshop, uniting a star-studded lineup of characters and worlds from across the LEGO universe to show the creativity and joy that goes into every brick, making them hard to let go of.  \n - Families are invited to “Gift the joy of LEGO bricks” as new research reveals that 89% wish they spent more time playing together and 24% of parents admit they have bought a LEGO set as a gift knowing they'd enjoy it too!  \n - LEGO stores worldwide turn into Holiday Workshops with festive experiences including Pick a Brick, Build A Mini, Minifigure Factory and LEGO #BuildToGive.  \n - Shop the LEGO Holiday collection featured in the ad at [LEGO.com/shop-christmas-ad][1].\n\n.\n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/shop-Christmas-ad","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"05774a3e-94f5-48fd-9e90-f4fcf8015a0e","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs6dbf6294fb01f25b"},"text":"**BILLUND, DENMARK, 5th NOVEMBER 2026:** It’s that time of the year! The LEGO Group has just dropped its global holiday campaign advert, inviting families behind the secret doors of ‘The LEGO Holiday Workshop’, where the magic behind every LEGO® set comes to life - making them the perfect gifts this holiday season.   \n\nCreated by Our LEGO Agency (OLA) and helmed by Michael Gracey, director of Oscar and Golden Globe nominated The Greatest Showman and Better Man, the 74-sec film follows a single 2x4 LEGO brick on an epic journey through the LEGO Holiday Workshop, meeting a cast of familiar faces and passing through a series of spectacular departments, before finally becoming a gift. \n\n**Michael Gracey, Director of The LEGO Holiday Workshop, said:** *“I loved the concept that behind this secret door, there might be an entire world you never knew existed. And with LEGO bricks, that world really could be anything. We decided to tell the story through the eyes of one little LEGO brick, following its journey through this extraordinary workshop as it passes from one character to the next. I love that something so small connects so many iconic characters from completely different universes as they each contribute to a single creation. At its heart, it’s an idea I’ve always believed in — that there’s something incredibly joyful about making something with your own hands, but perhaps, an even greater joy in giving it to someone else.\"* \n\nSet to Daft Punk’s iconic hit ‘One More Time’, the film spotlights beloved LEGO minifigures pouring all their passion into building the most joyful LEGO sets ever made, so full of joy, they’re “hard to let go” of.   \n\n  ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"bltbb3f94dd4681e8b6","_version":1,"parent_uid":"bltd38c3d14195318cf","title":"AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd - 1080p (0-00-16-19).jpg","created_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","updated_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","created_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:53.207Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:53.207Z","content_type":"image/jpeg","file_size":"459442","filename":"AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd_-_1080p_(0-00-16-19).jpg","ACL":{},"is_dir":false,"tags":[],"publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-05T09:01:46.950Z","user":"blt84865cd37210c29c","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltbb3f94dd4681e8b6/AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd_-_1080p_(0-00-16-19).jpg"},"alt":"ICE BRICK"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs949ccbdf20c229d2"},"text":"Wearing their trademark helmets, the film opens with Daft Punk minifigures racing through the snow towards a tiny, glowing yellow LEGO door. Together with LEGO® F1 ACADEMY™ driver Esmee Kosterman and Yeti minifigures, they’re late for work. The door swings open and they all leap through a swirling neon portal into the LEGO Holiday Workshop where we follow the LEGO brick bouncing between the Northern Lights, Heroes, Vehicles and Music departments.   \n\nYeti minifigures send icy blasts flying, while Thor, Doctor Doom and Mystique infuse the brick with their powers in **Heroes**. Moving into **Vehicles**, engineer minifigures and two unicorns give it race-car acceleration. Powered up, the brick zooms into **Music**, dancing above a Daft Punk concert as the DJ duo bring their music powers alive in a LED Pyramid stage, before disappearing into a vortex and landing inside a LEGO gift bag.  ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"bltfb2d1dff8b12d45f","_version":1,"parent_uid":"bltd38c3d14195318cf","title":"AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd - 1080p (0-00-45-23).jpg","created_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","updated_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","created_at":"2026-11-04T15:22:11.223Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:22:11.223Z","content_type":"image/jpeg","file_size":"635830","filename":"AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd_-_1080p_(0-00-45-23).jpg","ACL":{},"is_dir":false,"tags":[],"publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-05T09:01:40.127Z","user":"blt84865cd37210c29c","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltfb2d1dff8b12d45f/AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd_-_1080p_(0-00-45-23).jpg"},"alt":"HERO3"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csa4d67b7ab203a6b5"},"text":"The adventure culminates in a heartwarming holiday moment as the crew reluctantly send their creations out into the world, with ET, K-Pop Demon Hunters’ Derpy Tiger, the NINJAGO Twin Titans and LEGO minifigures among those bidding it a tearful farewell. The scene switches to a festive living room, where a young girl begins to unwrap her gift. A thump at the window interrupts the moment: it’s the LEGO Workshop crew, faces squished against the glass, unable to part with their beloved bricks. As One More Time kicks back in, the crew joins the family, because sometimes the best part of gifting a LEGO set is getting to build it together.  \n\n**Genevieve Hoey, Senior Director, Global Creative at Our LEGO Agency, the LEGO Group, said:** *“Finding the perfect gift isn’t easy. But that’s the beauty of LEGO creativity. So many worlds, so many passions, and something for everyone. The only hard part? Giving it away. Trust us, we get it. So together with incredible talents like director Michael Gracey and music legends DAFT PUNK™, we’ve brought a little extra magic to this year’s holiday season. We hope this film captures that feeling - The joy of giving, the excitement of receiving, and the temptation to keep the gift for yourself. One more time.”*   ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blta9c54a20dce32b3d","_version":1,"parent_uid":"bltd38c3d14195318cf","title":"AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd - 1080p (0-00-55-21).jpg","created_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","updated_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","created_at":"2026-11-04T15:22:11.065Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:22:11.065Z","content_type":"image/jpeg","file_size":"342522","filename":"AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd_-_1080p_(0-00-55-21).jpg","ACL":{},"is_dir":false,"tags":[],"publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-05T09:01:48.567Z","user":"blt84865cd37210c29c","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blta9c54a20dce32b3d/AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd_-_1080p_(0-00-55-21).jpg"},"alt":"HERO3"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csd77e93997a691a53"},"text":"Accompanying the LEGO Holiday Workshop Advert are seven short-form 15-second passion films, lifting the curtain to the workshop departments of Adventure, Discovery, Gaming, Nature, New Stories, LEGO Pokémon and Vehicles, showing a wider range of LEGO characters and products available for gifting this holiday season. ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csfda10e65d8a7610b"},"text":"**GIFT THE JOY OF LEGO BRICKS THIS HOLIDAY SEASON**   \nIt turns out the LEGO Holiday Workshop team aren’t the only ones who find LEGO bricks hard to let go. New research* from the LEGO Group reveals that 24% of parents have bought a LEGO set as a gift partly because it would bring them joy too, with 19% confessing they have ended up buying a second set to keep one for themselves and 11% finding it so hard to let go they ended up keeping the LEGO set.  \n\nNo judging here. We know everyone wants in on the fun, and with 89% of families wishing they spent more time playing together, gifting the joy of LEGO bricks this season is your chance to become a holiday hero. For those wanting to share the joy even more, head to the [LEGO Builder app][1] and use the Build Together feature that helps turn over 1000 compatible LEGO sets into fun family experiences, splitting the building instructions across up to 6 devices, depending on the set. \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/builder-app#blt0cdf6fea010206f5","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt53978398510435f8","_version":1,"parent_uid":"bltd38c3d14195318cf","title":"AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd - 1080p (0-01-06-01).jpg","created_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","updated_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","created_at":"2026-11-04T15:09:34.049Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:09:34.049Z","content_type":"image/jpeg","file_size":"590875","filename":"AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd_-_1080p_(0-01-06-01).jpg","ACL":{},"is_dir":false,"tags":[],"publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-05T09:01:38.485Z","user":"blt84865cd37210c29c","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt53978398510435f8/AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd_-_1080p_(0-01-06-01).jpg"},"alt":"FAMILY"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs5885f45cf23e9aa0"},"text":"**BRINGING THE LEGO HOLIDAY WORKSHOP TO LIFE**  \nLEGO Brand Retail Stores have been transformed into Holiday workshops, bringing the campaign to life through a series of festive events including Pick a Brick and Build A Mini activities, Minifigure Factory experiences and opportunities to take part in LEGO **#BuildToGive**, building a LEGO heart that helps support children through play.  \n\n LEGO Flagship Stores in New York's 5th Avenue and London's Leicester Square will offer fans a glimpse behind the Holiday Workshop through an immersive storefront display packed with festive storytelling, interactive surprises and larger-than-life LEGO creativity. Visitors can watch a team of playful Yetis hard at work as they sort bricks, inspect festive builds and prepare gifts, while hidden magical moments encourage guests to engage with the busy team behind the holiday magic. As day turns to night, the displays dramatically transform, revealing a whole new side of the workshop and encouraging guests to return again and again throughout the holiday season.  \n\nAround the world, LEGO teams are excited to get creative with fans. In Japan, celebrations include a nationwide travelling Christmas ornament-building experience, a build-inspired movie starring Daisuke Sakuma, and events at LEGO® Certified Stores. Meanwhile, master builders across Australia can visit a festive LEGO holiday playground at Sydney's Pitt Street Mall, featuring a giant brick-built Christmas tree and magical seasonal entertainment. UK families will be invited to step inside the interactive touring LEGO Giftmas Workshop. In Canada and Mexico, celebrations will include in-store Make + Take experiences and Santa Claus Parades in key cities. Across the US, fans can join holiday build nights led by Brick Specialists and use Minifigure Machines to collect vouchers for a free Minifigure at their nearest LEGO Store.  \n\n**SHOP THE LEGO HOLIDAY WORKSHOP ADVERT**  \nThe LEGO Holiday collection brings the worlds seen in the Ad to life, with gifts for every kind of builder. Fans can discover all products featured at [LEGO.com/shop-christmas-ad][1] \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/shop-Christmas-ad","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"Notes to Editors","_metadata":{"uid":"csfa117b108da22785"},"text":"For more information, please contact: [media@LEGO.com][1] \n\n***Research methodology:** Quantitative online survey during the period of 23.09.2026 - 29.09.2026. Respondents included 11,001 parents of children aged 3-16 across the UK, USA, France, Germany, Australia, Czech Republic, Japan, South Korea, Mexico, Canada, and Poland.  \n\n**About the LEGO Group** \nThe LEGO Group’s mission is to inspire and develop the builders of tomorrow through the power of play. The LEGO System in Play, with its foundation in LEGO bricks, allows children and fans to build and rebuild anything they can imagine. \n\nThe LEGO Group was founded in Billund, Denmark in 1932 by Ole Kirk Kristiansen, its name derived from the two Danish words LEg GOdt, which mean “Play Well”. Today, the LEGO Group remains a family-owned company headquartered in Billund. Its products are now sold in more than 120 countries worldwide. \n\nFor more information please visit: [www. LEGO.com][2] \n\n\n  [1]: media@LEGO.com\n  [2]: www.%20LEGO.com","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}}],"created_at":"2026-11-04T15:33:16.197Z","created_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","manchet":{"title":"The LEGO Group unveils 2026 Holiday AD – where gifts are built    with so much joy, they’re (REALLY) hard to let go of","text":"It’s that time of the year! The LEGO Group has just dropped its global holiday campaign advert, inviting families behind the secret doors of ‘The LEGO Holiday Workshop’, where the magic behind every LEGO® set comes to life - making them the perfect gifts this holiday season. ","image":{"file":{"uid":"bltd6cd70a9d8e3f5e1","_version":1,"parent_uid":"bltd38c3d14195318cf","title":"AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd - 1080p (0-00-06-08).jpg","created_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","updated_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","created_at":"2026-11-04T15:09:33.936Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:09:33.936Z","content_type":"image/jpeg","file_size":"603078","filename":"AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd_-_1080p_(0-00-06-08).jpg","ACL":{},"is_dir":false,"tags":[],"publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-05T09:01:41.737Z","user":"blt84865cd37210c29c","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltd6cd70a9d8e3f5e1/AID262GL7c2755b5_LEGO_Brand_Hol26_2HY26_Hero_NoPack_74s_16x9_25p_OLV_Social_Titled_WIP_20261027_hd_-_1080p_(0-00-06-08).jpg"},"alt":"HERO "}},"media_assets":[],"page_headline":"The LEGO Group unveils 2026 Holiday AD – where gifts are built with so much joy, they’re (REALLY) hard to let go of","related_articles":[],"release_date":"2026-11-05T09:00:00.000Z","seo_description":"Discover the LEGO Group’s 2026 Holiday ad, where imagination turns LEGO bricks into joyful gifts that are (really) hard to let go of","show_social_sharing":true,"spotlight":false,"tags":[],"title":"The LEGO Group unveils its 2026 Holiday ad","updated_at":"2026-11-05T10:52:26.074Z","updated_by":"blt84865cd37210c29c","url":"/news/2026/november/the-lego-group-unveils-its-2026-holiday-ad","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-05T10:52:32.516Z","user":"blt84865cd37210c29c","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"bltf3025d39ffe98e04","locale":"en-us","_version":15,"ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"asset_bundle":{"uid":"blt03c6e5377ee314e7","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"application/zip","created_at":"2026-11-03T10:04:15.441Z","created_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","file_size":"462753004","filename":"21375_Media_Assets.zip","parent_uid":"blt633e9fddcb82cfdf","tags":[],"title":"21375 Media Assets.zip","updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:04:15.441Z","updated_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-03T14:00:07.533Z","user":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt03c6e5377ee314e7/21375_Media_Assets.zip"},"author":"","categories":[{"uid":"blt239af1885dbcd645","title":"Products","tags":[],"locale":"en-us","created_by":"blt03df1cfe4451465a","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","created_at":"2019-05-27T10:35:55.907Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:52.202Z","ACL":{},"_version":7,"display_title":"Products","category_color":"#8952ba","_in_progress":false,"special_category":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:11:46.412Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"bltfc4d64d99f5a2fe3","_version":4,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"category_color":"#00a3da","created_at":"2024-11-07T13:15:50.881Z","created_by":"blt95f972fd032911c0","display_title":"Press Releases","special_category":true,"tags":[],"title":"Press Releases","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:32.213Z","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","publish_details":{"time":"2025-12-19T13:04:40.633Z","user":"blt95f972fd032911c0","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}}],"components":[{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csfc46980eaaca11af"},"text":"","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt21b6f556aa810e7b","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-11-03T10:07:03.600Z","created_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","file_size":"24159110","filename":"21375_image_1.jpg","parent_uid":"blt633e9fddcb82cfdf","tags":[],"title":"21375 image 1.jpg","updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:07:03.600Z","updated_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-03T14:00:10.047Z","user":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt21b6f556aa810e7b/21375_image_1.jpg"},"alt":"21375 image"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs8b5a1839bccc645f"},"text":" - 5,363-piece set is the largest LEGO® Ideas model ever launched, standing at 70cm tall \n - Features a posable head, arms, legs and tail, alongside authentic details such as Godzilla’s Heat Ray, scaly skin and jagged dorsal fins \n - To celebrate the launch on Black Friday, activities include a special livestream event, [LEGO Insiders][1] rewards and an exclusive LEGO Godzilla Gift with Purchase* \n - Available from 27 November 2026 at [LEGO.com/Godzilla][2] and LEGO Stores\n\n**BILLUND, DENMARK, 3 NOVEMBER 2026:** For over 70 years, his roar has signaled the arrival of something colossal. Now, Legendary’s Monsterverse Godzilla enters the LEGO Group portfolio with the LEGO® Ideas Godzilla (21375) set: a towering, 5,363-piece tribute to the King of Monsters and the largest LEGO Ideas model ever launched.  \n\nCapturing one of cinema’s most legendary kaiju, the new set invites builders to unleash their imagination and bring the Titan to life, piece by piece. Since first emerging on screen in 1954, Godzilla has roared through more than seven decades of film, television, comics, games and collectibles. The LEGO Ideas Godzilla set celebrates that remarkable journey, giving fans a new way to build and connect with a character that has remained a testament to the power of storytelling.  \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-gb/insiders\n  [2]: https://www.lego.com/product/godzilla-21375/?cmp=REF-202611-Godzilla_Laun","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs8f329b2f3a0776bf"},"text":"","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"bltb3ea28a62204c090","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-11-03T10:07:03.564Z","created_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","file_size":"24458564","filename":"21375_image_2.jpg","parent_uid":"blt633e9fddcb82cfdf","tags":[],"title":"21375 image 2.jpg","updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:07:03.564Z","updated_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-03T14:00:04.692Z","user":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltb3ea28a62204c090/21375_image_2.jpg"},"alt":"21375 image"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csbcc32bffb3ac406a"},"text":"Designed with drama in mind, the built model stands over 70cm (27.5 in) tall when posed with its Heat Ray, commanding attention as a powerful display piece. To underline the model’s immense scale, a LEGO Minifigure reaches only as high as Godzilla’s ankle. \n\nThe set has been crafted to capture Godzilla’s unmistakable presence from every angle. Textured scaly skin, jagged dorsal fins and a sweeping tail illustrate the creature’s imposing form, while his adjustable shoulders, elbows, wrists and fingers allow fans to manoeuvre the Monster into poses fit for any battle. Builders can also swap the tongue for the included Heat Ray element, recreating Godzilla’s iconic upward roar and adding a dramatic burst of spectacle to the finished display.  \n\nThe LEGO Ideas Godzilla product idea was submitted by New York-based Fan Designer Matthew Esposito (LEGO Ideas username: MattE720), via the LEGO Ideas crowdsourcing platform. Once published, it achieved the landmark 10,000 vote status and following the rigorous selection process by the LEGO Ideas Review Board, was approved to be made into an official LEGO set. \n\n**Matthew Esposito comments:** “Building LEGO Godzilla was a real passion project. I’ve loved both LEGO building and Godzilla for years, so I wanted to capture his shape, scale and character as accurately as I could. The head was definitely the biggest challenge, but seeing the model come together and eventually reach 10,000 supporters after more than two years was incredible. I’m so grateful to everyone who supported the project and helped make this dream a reality.” \n\n“We were thrilled to partner with the LEGO Group to bring our titan to life in brick form,” said **Amber Sheppo, SVP, Consumer Products \u0026 Partnerships** at Legendary Entertainment. “From Matthew’s original vision to this truly epic creation, the LEGO Group has been an incredible partner every step of the way.” \n\nThe reveal of this Black Friday exclusive set coincides with the LEGO Group’s Black Friday/Cyber Monday (BFCM) kick-off event and Godzilla Day, and lines up with the theatrical release of Godzilla Minus Zero. Fans are invited to join the official LEGO BFCM reveal livestream, on 3 November at 12pm ET / 9am PT / 5pm GMT on [LEGO.com/live/black-friday][1], where they can get closer to the colossal new model and hear more about how Godzilla was brought to life in LEGO brick form. The livestream will offer fans the chance to hear directly from LEGO Designers Jordan David Scott and Jim Clayton, as well as LEGO Ideas fan designer Matthew Esposito, during a live Q\u0026A. Additionally, [LEGO Insiders][2]** will be offered the opportunity to enter a LEGO Insiders sweepstake for a chance to win a signed set and have a first look at the Godzilla poster reward. \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-gb/live\n  [2]: https://www.lego.com/en-gb/insiders","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs5134aafae06e92b6"},"text":"","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt26c58dd2f95e729d","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-11-03T10:07:03.750Z","created_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","file_size":"27626276","filename":"21375_image_3.jpg","parent_uid":"blt633e9fddcb82cfdf","tags":[],"title":"21375 image 3.jpg","updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:07:03.750Z","updated_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-03T14:00:16.016Z","user":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt26c58dd2f95e729d/21375_image_3.jpg"},"alt":"21375 image"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs07285b4c0e30de7b"},"text":"In addition, shoppers who purchase the new set between 27 – 30 November 2026 via [LEGO.com/Godzilla][1] or LEGO Stores will receive the LEGO Ideas Godzilla Logo and Footprint set (40888) as a Gift with Purchase*. The 359-piece build recreates the recognisable Godzilla logo against a cityscape backdrop, complete with authentic details including rival Mothra perched on one of the buildings, alongside a brick-built footprint, the exact size of the foot on the LEGO Ideas Godzilla set.  \n\nBuilders can also use the LEGO Builder app, which includes 3D digital instructions, zoom and rotate tools and progress tracking to support every stage of the construction. \n\nThe LEGO Ideas Godzilla (21375) set will be available from 27 November 2026 via [LEGO.com/Godzilla][2] and LEGO Stores, priced at £349.99 GBP / €399.99 EUR / $449.99 USD. \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/product/godzilla-21375/?cmp=REF-202611-Godzilla_Laun\n  [2]: https://www.lego.com/product/godzilla-21375/?cmp=REF-202611-Godzilla_Laun","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"Notes to Editor","_metadata":{"uid":"cs29c96088d91932e4"},"text":"*While supplies last.  \n\n**Select markets only. Membership required, T\u0026Cs apply. \n\n**Product Information** \nLEGO® Ideas Godzilla (21375) set \n - Age: 18+ \n - RRP: £349.99 GBP / €399.99 EUR/ $449.99 USD \n - Product Number: 21375 \n - Pieces: 5363 \n - Dimensions: This 5,363-piece monster figure when posed with Heat Ray stands at 27.5 in. (70 cm) tall, W: 10.5 in. (27cm), L:15.5 in. (40cm) \n - Available: Via LEGO Stores and [LEGO.com/Godzilla][1] \n - Available from: 27 November 2026\n\n**Gift with Purchase Information:** \nLEGO® Ideas Godzilla Logo and Footprint \n - Age: 18+ \n - Product number: 40888 \n - Dates: 27 November – 30 November or whilst supplies last \n - Minimum purchase: Shoppers will receive this gift when purchasing the new LEGO® Ideas Godzilla (21375) set, while supplies last. \n - Key features and functions: Spark movie memories and create your own striking sci-fi decor with this collectible LEGO® Ideas Godzilla Logo and Footprint building set (40888) for adults. Assemble the blue logo against a cityscape backdrop featuring rival Mothra atop one of the buildings. Display the sign connected to the footprint or separately.\n\n**About the LEGO Group** \nThe LEGO Group’s mission is to inspire and develop the builders of tomorrow through the power of play. The LEGO System in Play, with its foundation in LEGO bricks, allows children and fans to build and rebuild anything they can imagine. \n\nThe LEGO Group was founded in Billund, Denmark in 1932 by Ole Kirk Kristiansen, its name derived from the two Danish words LEg GOdt, which mean “Play Well”. \n\nToday, the LEGO Group remains a family-owned company headquartered in Billund. Its products are sold in more than 120 countries worldwide. For more information: www.LEGO.com. \n\n**About the LEGO® Ideas platform:** \nLEGO® Ideas offers fans the opportunity to submit their own brick creations with the chance to have their concept brought to life with the help of LEGO master designers and a share of the profits. Find out more at www.ideas.LEGO.com. \n\n**About Legendary’s Monsterverse**  \nLegendary’s Monsterverse is an expansive story universe of cross-platform experiences centering around humanity’s battle to survive in a world facing a catastrophic new reality - the monsters of our myths and legends are real. Beginning in 2014 with “Godzilla,” and continuing with “Kong: Skull Island” in 2017, “Godzilla: King of the Monsters” in 2019, “Godzilla vs. Kong” in 2021, and most recently the record-breaking “Godzilla x Kong: The New Empire,” which grossed over $570 million worldwide and became the highest grossing Godzilla film of all time, the Monsterverse has accumulated over $2.5 billion at the global box office and continues to expand with the upcoming “Godzilla x Kong: Supernova,” set for release in 2027, as well as Legendary’s “Monarch: Legacy of Monsters” for Apple TV, which debuted its second season in February 2026. Including an interconnected world of video games, graphic novels, toys and live experiences, the Monsterverse represents epic entertainment on the largest possible scale.  \n\n**About Legendary Entertainment**   \nLegendary Entertainment is a leading independent media studio with film (Legendary Pictures), television and digital (Legendary Television and Digital Media) and comics (Legendary Comics and Publishing) divisions dedicated to owning, producing and delivering content to worldwide audiences. Legendary has built a library of marquee media properties and has established itself as a trusted brand that consistently delivers high-quality, commercial entertainment and successfully translates the world’s most popular fan-driven IP. In aggregate, Legendary Pictures-associated productions have realized grosses of nearly $21 billion worldwide at the box office. To learn more, visit: www.legendary.com.Insert updated boilerplate  \n\nMONSTERVERSE is a registered trademark of Legend Pictures, LLC.  All Rights Reserved.   \n\nGODZILLA TM \u0026 © Toho Co., Ltd.  All Rights Reserved.    \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/product/godzilla-21375/?cmp=REF-202611-Godzilla_Laun","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}}],"created_at":"2026-11-03T09:45:27.555Z","created_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","manchet":{"title":"The King of the Monsters awakens: First-ever LEGO® set featuring Godzilla from Legendary’s Monsterverse® unveiled","text":"Legendary’s Monsterverse Godzilla enters the LEGO Group portfolio with the LEGO® Ideas Godzilla (21375) set: a towering, 5,363-piece tribute to the King of Monsters and the largest LEGO Ideas model ever launched.","image":{"file":{"uid":"blte57b418cf5d70bf0","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-11-03T11:44:45.536Z","created_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","file_size":"25299770","filename":"21375_Lifestyle_Envr_03.jpg","parent_uid":"blt633e9fddcb82cfdf","tags":[],"title":"21375_Lifestyle_Envr_03.jpg","updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:44:45.536Z","updated_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-03T14:00:13.533Z","user":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blte57b418cf5d70bf0/21375_Lifestyle_Envr_03.jpg"},"alt":"21375 image"}},"media_assets":[],"page_headline":"The King of the Monsters awakens: First-ever LEGO® set featuring Godzilla from Legendary’s Monsterverse® unveiled","related_articles":[],"release_date":"2026-11-03T09:39:28.000Z","seo_description":"The King of the Monsters awakens: First-ever LEGO® set featuring Godzilla from Legendary’s Monsterverse® unveiled","show_social_sharing":true,"spotlight":false,"tags":["product"],"title":"First-ever LEGO® set featuring Godzilla","updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:52:08.623Z","updated_by":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","url":"/news/2026/november/first-ever-lego-set-featuring-godzilla","publish_details":{"time":"2026-11-03T14:00:02.104Z","user":"bltb79a5b10c697666f","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"blte558192b274ee1da","locale":"en-us","_version":7,"ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"asset_bundle":{"uid":"bltf7fa0c7f712b6a40","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"application/zip","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:49:53.922Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"556113527","filename":"LEGO_Friends_Unicorn_Cafe_Media_Assets.zip","parent_uid":"blt7bff83f8185a871d","tags":[],"title":"LEGO Friends Unicorn Cafe_Media Assets.zip","updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:49:53.922Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-28T14:50:08.430Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltf7fa0c7f712b6a40/LEGO_Friends_Unicorn_Cafe_Media_Assets.zip"},"author":"","categories":[{"uid":"blt239af1885dbcd645","title":"Products","tags":[],"locale":"en-us","created_by":"blt03df1cfe4451465a","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","created_at":"2019-05-27T10:35:55.907Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:52.202Z","ACL":{},"_version":7,"display_title":"Products","category_color":"#8952ba","_in_progress":false,"special_category":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:11:46.412Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"blt1dd946dbb217c9f8","title":"Friends","display_title":"Friends","category_color":"#E3599D","special_category":true,"tags":[],"locale":"en-us","created_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","created_at":"2025-01-30T08:27:49.312Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T13:04:18.918Z","ACL":{},"_version":2,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:15:56.158Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"bltfc4d64d99f5a2fe3","_version":4,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"category_color":"#00a3da","created_at":"2024-11-07T13:15:50.881Z","created_by":"blt95f972fd032911c0","display_title":"Press Releases","special_category":true,"tags":[],"title":"Press Releases","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:32.213Z","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","publish_details":{"time":"2025-12-19T13:04:40.633Z","user":"blt95f972fd032911c0","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}}],"components":[{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs9ee86c1de303f924"},"text":" - Three new LEGO® Friends sets launching 1 January 2027 make their debut at a LEGO Friends Unicorn Café pop-up experience in London, bringing new Heartlake City adventures to life. \n - A LEGO set, turned Musical setting, turned live-experience pop-up: The LEGO Friends Unicorn café set come to life in three ways \n - Families can get a first look at the new LEGO Friends sets, alongside hands-on building, musical screenings and photo opportunities at the free pop-up, running 29–31 October.","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt8013f059e74ce279","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:38:08.867Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"6671837","filename":"01_LEGO_Friends_Unicorn_Café_-_London_Pop-Up_October_2026_exterior.JPG","parent_uid":"blt7bff83f8185a871d","tags":[],"title":"01_LEGO Friends Unicorn Café - London Pop-Up October 2026_exterior.JPG","updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:38:08.867Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-28T14:50:10.772Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt8013f059e74ce279/01_LEGO_Friends_Unicorn_Café_-_London_Pop-Up_October_2026_exterior.JPG"},"alt":"Placeholder"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csa51155fc8f3a46d8"},"text":"**LONDON, UNITED KINGDOM, 28 OCTOBER 2026:** Today, the LEGO Group unveiled three new LEGO® Friends sets, launching 1 January 2027. The reveal took place at the LEGO Friends Unicorn Café pop-up at Potters Fields Park, London, which is open for fans from 29–31 October, with free tickets available [here][1]. \n\nFans can step inside the LEGO Friends Unicorn Café pop-up experience, that’s inspired by the LEGO Friends Unicorn Dream Café set and one of the scenes from LEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical. \n\nWith a ticket at-hand, visitors can enjoy exclusive screenings and sing-along moments from the musical, take part in hands-on building challenges and build-alongs, create a take-home model, explore themed spaces, capture shareable photos, and enjoy themed drinks and treats. The experience offers families and fans of all ages a playful way to celebrate creativity, friendship and self-expression. \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-gb/themes/friends/about","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt33b4c5c6d1126b71","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-10-27T23:37:42.108Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"8073195","filename":"42718_Lifestyle_Cons_crop.jpg","parent_uid":"blt7bff83f8185a871d","tags":[],"title":"42718_Lifestyle_Cons_crop.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-27T23:37:42.108Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-28T14:50:17.215Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt33b4c5c6d1126b71/42718_Lifestyle_Cons_crop.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO Friends Party Bus"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs66a8d55aca966c84"},"text":"The three new LEGO Friends sets are packed with opportunities for imaginative play, from celebrations on the move to shopping trips with friends and adventures with much-loved pets.  \n\nReady to get the party rolling? The **LEGO Friends Friendship Party Bus** allows fans to hit the road for a nonstop mobile celebration. The 676-piece set offers builders fun play experiences such as a private pool with rooftop slide, karaoke microphones and a cupcake party. The set includes Leo, Allya, Liann, Daisy and Churro the cat. ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt8925785b6240757c","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-10-27T23:39:19.306Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"17201755","filename":"42719_Lifestyle_cons.jpg","parent_uid":"blt7bff83f8185a871d","tags":[],"title":"42719_Lifestyle_cons.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-27T23:39:19.306Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-28T14:50:13.494Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt8925785b6240757c/42719_Lifestyle_cons.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO Friends Mall"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csd110eebf5826f4de"},"text":"A fun day out! The **LEGO Friends Heartlake City Shopping Mall** is a 843-piece set and designed for play and storytelling. It features Irene, Nova, Liann and Leo. Together they can hit the shops, ride the working elevator or play with the working toy vending machine.","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blta4e6bda773eb9219","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-10-27T23:39:18.596Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"15814339","filename":"42709_Lifestyle_envr.jpg","parent_uid":"blt7bff83f8185a871d","tags":[],"title":"42709_Lifestyle_envr.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-27T23:39:18.596Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-28T14:50:15.543Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blta4e6bda773eb9219/42709_Lifestyle_envr.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO Friends Pet Care Center"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs8e5de235cb2d49e4"},"text":"The ultimate furry friend retreat! The **LEGO Friends Pet Care \u0026 Play Center**, invites fans to take their LEGO Friends pets to a relaxing and fun retreat with Leo, Nova and Amara, together with Peanut the dog, Churro the cat, Brownie the bunny and axolotl Bubbles. The pets can slide, balance on the seesaw or climb the brick-built cat tree. The set contains 366-pieces. \n\nThe new LEGO Friends sets will be available worldwide from 1 January 2027 via retailers, on [LEGO.com][1] and LEGO Stores.\n\n**Fans can step inside the world of LEGO Friends at the Unicorn Café pop-up in London. Free tickets can be booked [here][2], with spaces available on a first-come, first-served basis.**\n\n**Watch LEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical now on the [LEGO YouTube channel][3].**\n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-gb/themes/friends\n  [2]: https://www.lego.com/en-gb/themes/friends/about\n  [3]: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jk9Y2Z_QNmE","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"Notes for editors","_metadata":{"uid":"cs8b9a597e79c8da90"},"text":"**LEGO® Friends Friendship Party Bus** \n - Age: 7+ \n - Price: 59,99 EUR/59,99 USD/54,99£  \n - Pieces: 676 \n - Product No.: 42718 \n - Dimensions: Measures over 6.5 in. (16 cm) high, 8.5 in. (22 cm) long and 4 in. (11 cm) wide \n - Available: 1st January 2027\n\n**LEGO® Friends Heartlake City Shopping Mall** \n - Age: 7+ \n - Price: 99,99€ / 99,99$ / 89,99£ \n - Pieces: 843 \n - Product No.: 42719 \n - Dimensions: Measures over 9 in. (22 cm) high and 16 in. (40 cm) wide and 7.5 in. (19 cm) deep \n - Available: 1st January 2027\n\n**LEGO® Friends Pet Care \u0026 Play Centre**\n - Age: 7+ \n - Price: 49,99 EUR/49,99 USD/44,99 £ \n - Pieces: 366 \n - Product No.: 42709 \n - Dimensions: Measures over 5.5 in. (14 cm) high, 8 in. (20 cm) long and 4 in. (10 cm) wide \n - Available: 1st January 2027\n\n**About the LEGO Group**  \nThe LEGO Group’s mission is to inspire and develop the builders of tomorrow through the power of play. The LEGO System in Play, with its foundation in LEGO bricks, allows children and fans to build and rebuild anything they can imagine. \n\nThe LEGO Group was founded in Billund, Denmark in 1932 by Ole Kirk Kristiansen, its name derived from the two Danish words LEg GOdt, which mean “Play Well”. Today, the LEGO Group remains a family-owned company headquartered in Billund. However, its products are now sold in more than 130 countries worldwide. \n\nFor more news from the LEGO Group, information about our financial performance and responsibility engagement, please visit [www.LEGO.com/aboutus][1]. \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/aboutus","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}}],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:49:35.917Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","manchet":{"title":"LEGO® Friends reveal three new sets at magical Unicorn Café pop-up","text":"the LEGO Group unveiled three new LEGO® Friends sets, launching 1 January 2027. The reveal took place at the LEGO Friends Unicorn Café pop-up at Potters Fields Park, London, which is opened for fans from 29–31 October, 2026.","image":{"file":{"uid":"blt8013f059e74ce279","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:38:08.867Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"6671837","filename":"01_LEGO_Friends_Unicorn_Café_-_London_Pop-Up_October_2026_exterior.JPG","parent_uid":"blt7bff83f8185a871d","tags":[],"title":"01_LEGO Friends Unicorn Café - London Pop-Up October 2026_exterior.JPG","updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:38:08.867Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-28T14:50:10.772Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt8013f059e74ce279/01_LEGO_Friends_Unicorn_Café_-_London_Pop-Up_October_2026_exterior.JPG"},"alt":"Placeholder"}},"media_assets":[],"page_headline":"LEGO® Friends reveal three new sets at magical Unicorn Café pop-up","related_articles":["blt11af4685f412b17a","blta5b553eac02ee801"],"release_date":"2026-10-28T15:00:00.000Z","seo_description":"LEGO Group unveiled three new LEGO Friends sets LEGO Friends Unicorn Café pop-up at Potters Fields Park London","show_social_sharing":true,"spotlight":false,"tags":[],"title":"LEGO Friends Heartlake Unicorn Cafe \u0026 2027 sets","updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:54:28.659Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","url":"/news/2026/october/lego-friends-heartlake-unicorn-cafe","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-28T15:01:28.466Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"bltdeef68adada0c5ef","_version":2,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"asset_bundle":null,"author":"","categories":[{"uid":"bltdd111abcb0dd5415","title":"Responsibility","display_title":"Responsibility","category_color":"#cb1e93","tags":["responsibility"],"locale":"en-us","created_by":"blt7284b4b016d73d5a","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","created_at":"2019-08-26T19:47:30.075Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:14:13.539Z","ACL":{},"_version":6,"_in_progress":false,"special_category":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:11:46.652Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"blt09fd211bc2c38b3c","title":"Sustainability","display_title":"Sustainability","category_color":"#d12622","special_category":true,"tags":[],"locale":"en-us","created_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","created_at":"2025-02-10T08:02:56.717Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:15:03.507Z","ACL":{},"_version":3,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:11:46.114Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"bltfc4d64d99f5a2fe3","_version":4,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"category_color":"#00a3da","created_at":"2024-11-07T13:15:50.881Z","created_by":"blt95f972fd032911c0","display_title":"Press Releases","special_category":true,"tags":[],"title":"Press Releases","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:32.213Z","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","publish_details":{"time":"2025-12-19T13:04:40.633Z","user":"blt95f972fd032911c0","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"bltcb8533867a6a6ab9","title":"Partnerships","display_title":"Partnerships","category_color":"#2a007c","special_category":true,"tags":[],"locale":"en-us","created_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","created_at":"2025-02-10T08:00:18.112Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:10.133Z","ACL":{},"_version":5,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:11:46.686Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}}],"components":[{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs3cfb35cb73715813"},"text":"","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"aa8fdfcc-8c2d-4e72-ac4c-e6550ac95555","video":"","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csf332e77b8161cfa2"},"text":" - In three new videos, the LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop bring nature learning to life through stories and play with the Sesame Street friends.\n - The LEGO Group’s free guides and printables invite children to continue exploring through hands-on play with family members and educators.\n - The collaboration encourages children to look more closely at the natural world and build a connection with it.\n","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs0733cdf69736a0bd"},"text":"**BILLUND, Denmark, 27 October 2026**: The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop, the global nonprofit behind Sesame Street, have launched three new videos, funded by the LEGO Foundation, encouraging children aged 4 to 6 to discover the natural world through play. \n\nFeaturing Elmo, Cookie Monster and other Sesame Street friends, the videos introduce children to bats, butterflies and worms before inviting them to build habitats using LEGO bricks and everyday craft materials. The LEGO Group’s [free activity guides and printables][1] help families and educators extend the experience through hands-on play at home and in community settings. \n\nEach three-minute video focuses on one creature, its habitat, and the important role it plays in the ecosystem, helping young viewers understand how these creatures contribute to the natural world and why they matter.\n\nIn the bat video, Cookie Monster gets a fright from a bat before learning from The Count how bats help pollinate plants and protect crops, including cacao trees, where chocolate comes from. In the butterfly video, Elmo and Grover learn through building and crafting that butterflies are a sign of a healthy garden and set about creating more butterfly-friendly spaces. In the worm video, Oscar the Grouch shows Elmo how worms keep soil healthy and gardens growing. \n\nThe videos are the starting point for a wider nature learning experience. The LEGO Group’s activity guides and printables give caregivers and educators the tools to turn each film into hands-on play for children, at home or in museums, libraries and community groups. By building a habitat for a creature they have just met, children think through food, water and shelter and turn what they have watched into ideas of their own. Together, these activities encourage children to get outside, explore the natural world around them, and develop a lifelong love of nature.\n \n**Lauren von Stackelberg, VP and Head of Social Responsibility at the LEGO Group**, said: “Children look after what they love, and we want to help them fall in love with nature. Through play, something as simple as building a habitat can turn curiosity into care, and care into action. Together with Sesame Workshop, we’re helping children connect with nature and feel empowered to protect it.”\n \n**Samantha Kennedy, VP of Marketing and Brand Strategy at Sesame Workshop**, said: “For generations, families have trusted Sesame Street to help children explore the world with curiosity, kindness, and joy. Through engaging stories and beloved characters, we're helping children discover that their actions, no matter how small, can make a meaningful difference in caring for nature.”\n \nFrom today, families and educators can access the three videos and accompanying LEGO Group activities on the [Build the Change webpage][2], while the videos continue to roll out on Sesame Street’s YouTube channel.\n\n**This initiative does not include a commercial LEGO set or product. The videos and accompanying activities are free educational resources available to families and educators.**\n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-us/sustainability/btc-sesame-workshop\n  [2]: https://www.lego.com/buildthechangewithsesame","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"Notes to editor","_metadata":{"uid":"csa40462f5751193ae"},"text":"For more information, assets, or interview opportunities, please contact [media@LEGO.com][1].\n \n**About Build the Change**\nBuild the Change is a LEGO Group social impact programme, supported by the LEGO Foundation. It invites children around the world to use creativity to explore real-world challenges and share their ideas. Build the Change for Little Ones adapts the programme for children aged 4 to 6.\n\n**About the LEGO Group**\nThe LEGO Group’s mission is to inspire and develop the builders of tomorrow through the power of play. The LEGO System in Play, with its foundation in LEGO bricks, allows children and fans to build and rebuild anything they can imagine.\n \nThe LEGO Group was founded in Billund, Denmark in 1932 by Ole Kirk Kristiansen, its name derived from the two Danish words Leg Godt, which mean “Play Well”.\n \nToday, the LEGO Group remains a family-owned company headquartered in Billund. Its products are now sold in more than 120 countries worldwide.\n\nFor more information: [www.LEGO.com][2]\n\n**About Sesame Workshop**\nSesame Workshop is the global nonprofit behind Sesame Street with a mission to help children everywhere grow smarter, stronger, and kinder. We support children and the caring adults in their lives in the moments that shape early childhood, reaching families with playful learning in over 190 countries. Through beloved characters and joyful educational media, Sesame helps children understand themselves, connect with others, and make sense of an ever-changing world. Learn more at [www.sesame.org][3] and follow Sesame Workshop on [Instagram][4], [TikTok][5], [Facebook][6], [Threads][7], and [X][8].\n\n\n  [1]: mailto:media@LEGO.com\n  [2]: www.LEGO.com\n  [3]: https://www.sesameworkshop.org/\n  [4]: https://www.instagram.com/sesameworkshop/?hl=en\n  [5]: https://www.tiktok.com/@sesamestreet?is_from_webapp=1\u0026sender_device=pc\n  [6]: https://www.facebook.com/SesameWorkshop/\n  [7]: https://www.threads.com/@sesamestreet\n  [8]: https://twitter.com/SesameWorkshop?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}}],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:59:30.344Z","created_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","manchet":{"title":"The LEGO Group teams up with Sesame Street to inspire young children to fall in love with nature","text":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop, the global nonprofit behind Sesame Street, have launched three new videos, funded by the LEGO Foundation, encouraging children aged 4 to 6 to discover the natural world through play. \nFeaturing Elmo, Cookie Monster and other Sesame Street friends, the videos introduce children to bats, butterflies and worms before inviting them to build habitats using LEGO bricks and everyday craft materials. The LEGO Group’s free activity guides and printables help families and educators extend the experience through hands-on play at home and in community settings. ","image":{"file":{"uid":"bltc42aa8ac8dcb8078","_version":2,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-10-27T09:55:50.574Z","created_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","file_size":"9804275","filename":"Final_BM_YT_Lego_Sponsorship_YouTube_End_Card_2026_Cookie_Count_Elmo_1.png","parent_uid":"bltcd7ce90df8592e26","tags":[],"title":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop HERO","updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:39.735Z","updated_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-27T09:58:54.042Z","user":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltc42aa8ac8dcb8078/Final_BM_YT_Lego_Sponsorship_YouTube_End_Card_2026_Cookie_Count_Elmo_1.png"},"alt":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop"}},"media_assets":[{"file":{"uid":"blt7c738df17a2ef5fd","_version":2,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-10-27T09:55:46.894Z","created_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","file_size":"9090752","filename":"the_LEGO_Group_x_Sesame_Street_1.png","parent_uid":"bltcd7ce90df8592e26","tags":[],"title":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop 1","updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:03.204Z","updated_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-27T09:58:47.140Z","user":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt7c738df17a2ef5fd/the_LEGO_Group_x_Sesame_Street_1.png"},"_metadata":{"uid":"cs73fd731a064dd8d8"},"description":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop"},{"file":{"uid":"blt7c818604918e4f2f","_version":2,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-10-27T09:54:56.674Z","created_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","file_size":"2273331","filename":"the_LEGO_Group_x_Sesame_Street_2.png","parent_uid":"bltcd7ce90df8592e26","tags":[],"title":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop 2","updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:15.292Z","updated_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-27T09:58:48.426Z","user":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt7c818604918e4f2f/the_LEGO_Group_x_Sesame_Street_2.png"},"_metadata":{"uid":"cs74427cbfbdd331ca"},"description":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop"},{"file":{"uid":"blt276e8e10c3fd7211","_version":2,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-10-27T09:55:54.540Z","created_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","file_size":"10796234","filename":"the_LEGO_Group_x_Sesame_Street_3.jpg","parent_uid":"bltcd7ce90df8592e26","tags":[],"title":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop 3","updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:20.632Z","updated_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-27T09:58:49.565Z","user":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt276e8e10c3fd7211/the_LEGO_Group_x_Sesame_Street_3.jpg"},"_metadata":{"uid":"cs3f1df913f77e1cd7"},"description":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop"},{"file":{"uid":"bltc185c23e4f016f9a","_version":2,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-10-27T09:56:27.263Z","created_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","file_size":"25918396","filename":"the_LEGO_Group_x_Sesame_Street_4.png","parent_uid":"bltcd7ce90df8592e26","tags":[],"title":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop 4","updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:26.471Z","updated_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-27T09:58:51.074Z","user":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltc185c23e4f016f9a/the_LEGO_Group_x_Sesame_Street_4.png"},"_metadata":{"uid":"cs9405f8dc4fb82c57"},"description":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop"},{"file":{"uid":"blta5b7fb64acc25f57","_version":2,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-10-27T09:56:26.802Z","created_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","file_size":"23695199","filename":"the_LEGO_Group_x_Sesame_Street_5.png","parent_uid":"bltcd7ce90df8592e26","tags":[],"title":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop 5","updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:32.465Z","updated_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-27T09:58:52.772Z","user":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blta5b7fb64acc25f57/the_LEGO_Group_x_Sesame_Street_5.png"},"_metadata":{"uid":"cs0d587295995c4e6e"},"description":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop"}],"page_headline":"The LEGO Group teams up with Sesame Street to inspire young children to fall in love with nature","related_articles":[],"release_date":"2026-10-27T09:45:26.000Z","seo_description":"The LEGO Group and Sesame Workshop, the global nonprofit behind Sesame Street, have launched three new videos, funded by the LEGO Foundation.","show_social_sharing":true,"spotlight":false,"tags":[],"title":"The LEGO Group teams up with Sesame Street","updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:00:42.387Z","updated_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","url":"/news/2026/october/the-lego-group-teams-up-with-sesame-street-to-inspire-young-children-to-fall-in-love-with-nature","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-27T10:00:46.435Z","user":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"blt7a5992db543ee487","locale":"en-us","_version":10,"ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"asset_bundle":{"uid":"blt731adc933173311a","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"application/zip","created_at":"2026-10-22T11:33:21.280Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"189539897","filename":"LEGO_Group_\u0026_DAFT_PUNK_Media_Asset_Toolkit.zip","parent_uid":"blt54bc8afafc0775e9","tags":[],"title":"LEGO Group \u0026 DAFT PUNK_Media Asset Toolkit.zip","updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:33:21.280Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-22T12:43:11.592Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt731adc933173311a/LEGO_Group_\u0026_DAFT_PUNK_Media_Asset_Toolkit.zip"},"author":"","categories":[{"uid":"bltcb8533867a6a6ab9","title":"Partnerships","display_title":"Partnerships","category_color":"#2a007c","special_category":true,"tags":[],"locale":"en-us","created_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","created_at":"2025-02-10T08:00:18.112Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:10.133Z","ACL":{},"_version":5,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:11:46.686Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"bltfc4d64d99f5a2fe3","_version":4,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"category_color":"#00a3da","created_at":"2024-11-07T13:15:50.881Z","created_by":"blt95f972fd032911c0","display_title":"Press Releases","special_category":true,"tags":[],"title":"Press Releases","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:32.213Z","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","publish_details":{"time":"2025-12-19T13:04:40.633Z","user":"blt95f972fd032911c0","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}}],"components":[{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs67fe75acacb007fd"},"text":" - Rumours confirmed! DAFT PUNK™ to enter the LEGO® universe with new partnership aiming to connect generations of Daft Punk and LEGO fans through products, content and brand experiences. \n - Teaser left on ‘Daft Punk - WDPK 83.7’ featuring a 2x4 red LEGO brick gave fans the first hint of DAFT PUNK™ about to be reimagined in LEGO bricks. \n - First partnership milestone greenlights LEGO Ideas submission of a LEGO Daft Punk set, based on the iconic 2007 Alive tour, that will now go into development. \n - Hero film set to “Voyager” and “Human After All” takes fans on a cultural crossover.","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"493c6a87-e1a1-47f2-90f3-df97e880513c","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs19cddd7455bd62ac"},"text":"**BILLUND, DENMARK, 22 OCTOBER 2026:** Today, the LEGO Group and DAFT PUNK™ are proud to announce a new partnership that aims to inspire and remix fandoms, with the Daft Punk robots entering the LEGO universe. Spanning product, content and brand experiences, the collaboration celebrates the creativity and communities that have shaped the legacy of both brands. \n\nTo introduce the partnership, the two brands have unveiled a [film][1] in which the duo’s minifigures follow a holographic red brick through what starts as a dark, mysterious landscape. As the robots arrive and step inside the “gates-of-play”, the holographic architecture starts to unfold and envelop them beat by beat, brick by brick, until we finally see the pair manning a LEGO brick-built console. \n\nWorking together, the LEGO Group and DAFT PUNK™ explored the archives of Daft Punk's catalogue to identify two key iconic tracks befitting this exciting new partnership. The result is a film soundtracked by “Voyager”, a bassline tribute from Daft Punk’s 2001 Discovery album, and “Human After All,” the title track from their 2005 album – carrying them on their journey to become LEGO Builders After All. \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-gb/categories/adults-welcome/article/daft-punk","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt8505b9fa58e464e5","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-10-22T10:12:55.814Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"4244048","filename":"The_LEGO_Group_\u0026_DAFT_PUNK_HERO_Still_5_16x9.png","parent_uid":"blt54bc8afafc0775e9","tags":[],"title":"The LEGO Group \u0026 DAFT PUNK_HERO Still 5_16x9.png","updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:12:55.814Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-22T12:43:19.548Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt8505b9fa58e464e5/The_LEGO_Group_\u0026_DAFT_PUNK_HERO_Still_5_16x9.png"},"alt":"LEGO Daft Punk Minifigures"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs3fe04f543904a837"},"text":"**Julia Goldin**, **Chief Product \u0026 Marketing Officer at the LEGO Group** said \"*What makes this partnership so special is the enduring appeal both brands share. Like the LEGO brand, Daft Punk inspires generations through creativity, innovation and a deep connection with fans. We’re excited to build on these foundations to reimagine the Daft Punk legacy in a fresh and unexpected way, creating something unique that resonates with fans across all ages. This is just the beginning of a bigger journey – a creative collab made for fans ready to lose themselves to play.*“ \n\n**Clues left for fans watching closely**  \nFans tuning into ‘Daft Punk - WDPK 83.7’ on 21 October were met with an unexpected final transmission: a 30-second teaser featuring an iconic 2x4 red LEGO brick, with no further explanation. Shown from behind, its three internal tubes evoked speaker woofers, while clues continued to appear for viewers to decode this first hint of DAFT PUNK™ about to be reimagined in LEGO bricks.  \n\n**Fan-favourite comes ALIVE: LEGO Ideas greenlights [Daft Punk Concert][1] submission.** \nThe origins of this iconic partnership can be traced back to the LEGO Ideas community, where a Luxembourgish father-and-son passion project captured the attention of thousands of fellow Daft Punk and LEGO fans. \n\nFirst crowned Grand Prize Winner of the LEGO Ideas Music to Our Ears challenge in 2020 before later reaching 10,000 supporters on the LEGO Ideas platform, this fan idea will now advance into the next stage to officially become a LEGO set that fans around the world can build and enjoy across generations. Designed as the famous pyramid stage from Daft Punk’s 2007 ALIVE tour, this product launch will represent the ultimate symbol of shared fandom and the creative foundation of this partnership. \n\n\n  [1]: https://ideas.lego.com/product-ideas/4248139c-e8e8-47a9-852a-96e00d620012","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt9edf30da2baf2f68","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/webp","created_at":"2026-10-22T10:13:05.958Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"120522","filename":"NOT_FINAL_MODEL_The_LEGO_Group_\u0026_DAFT_PUNK_LEGO_Ideas_Submission_16x9.webp","parent_uid":"blt54bc8afafc0775e9","tags":[],"title":"NOT FINAL MODEL_The LEGO Group \u0026 DAFT PUNK_LEGO Ideas Submission_16x9.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:13:05.958Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-22T12:43:15.605Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt9edf30da2baf2f68/NOT_FINAL_MODEL_The_LEGO_Group_\u0026_DAFT_PUNK_LEGO_Ideas_Submission_16x9.webp"},"alt":"LEGO DAFT PUNK Concert LEGO Ideas Submission"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csfbff0d511e837fd1"},"text":"**FAN MODEL - NOT FINAL PRODUCT* \n\n**Patrick Harboun**, **owner of the LEGO Ideas Daft Punk Concert submission** said: “*This all started as a creative escape during lockdown between my son and I because of our shared love of Daft Punk and LEGO building. We never dared imagine it would take off in this way. Watching our passion project become part of an official collaboration is an incredible experience, and it's a reminder of what makes the LEGO Ideas community so special. That a simple idea, shared by fans, really can become something much bigger.*” \n\nBeyond a product collaboration, the partnership will see the duo brought to life in new ways across the LEGO brand, through a mashup of surprising events and content that crosses music, culture and creative spaces. So, whether you've been listening since Homework or discovered Daft Punk more recently, this partnership opens the door to experience more of the unmistakable world of Daft Punk through the limitless possibilities of LEGO creativity. \n\n**Cédric Hervet**, **Creative Director for DAFT PUNK™** said: “*The pyramid stage is one of the most recognisable expressions of Daft Punk’s visual world, so it feels fitting that this fan-created design will be centre stage of this partnership. Fans have always played an important part in Daft Punk’s story, and we are excited to see that creativity reflected through the LEGO universe.*” \n\nFor more than three decades, Daft Punk have redefined the relationship between music, design and visual culture. From the iconic robot personas themselves to the instantly recognisable pyramid stage, every release, performance and visual detail has become part of an artistic identity that continues to influence generations of musicians, designers and fans around the world. \n\nThe LEGO brand has long championed creativity, inspiring generations to imagine, build and rebuild. Like Daft Punk, it has continued to evolve, becoming part of popular culture, with a global community of fans who continue to reinterpret and shape its creative legacy. Now, they come together for the first time, opening the portal to new ways for fans to experience, interpret and build upon the world of Daft Punk in the LEGO universe. \n\n**More to come in 2027.** ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"Notes to Editors","_metadata":{"uid":"cs15ad0c3a3c6f4a71"},"text":"For more information, please contact: [media@LEGO.com][1] \n\n**About the LEGO Group** \nThe LEGO Group’s mission is to inspire and develop the builders of tomorrow through the power of play. The LEGO System in Play, with its foundation in LEGO bricks, allows children and fans to build and rebuild anything they can imagine. \n\nThe LEGO Group was founded in Billund, Denmark in 1932 by Ole Kirk Kristiansen, its name derived from the two Danish words Leg Godt, which mean “Play Well”. \n\nToday, the LEGO Group remains a family-owned company headquartered in Billund. Its products are now sold in more than 120 countries worldwide. \n \nFor more information: [www.LEGO.com][2]. \n \n\n**About the LEGO Ideas platform**  \nLEGO Ideas offers fans the opportunity to submit their own brick creations with the chance to have their concept brought to life with the help of LEGO master designers and a share of the profits. Find out more at [ideas.LEGO.com][3]. \n\n\n  [1]: mailto:media@LEGO.com\n  [2]: https://www.lego.com/en-us/aboutus/news/2026/september/www.LEGO.com\n  [3]: http://www.ideas.lego.com/","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}}],"created_at":"2026-10-22T10:14:34.771Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","manchet":{"title":"Builders After All: The LEGO Group and DAFT PUNK™ announce partnership – blending worlds of music, culture and creative experimentation","text":"The LEGO Group and DAFT PUNK™ are proud to announce a new partnership that aims to inspire and remix fandoms, with the Daft Punk robots entering the LEGO universe. Spanning product, content and brand experiences, the collaboration celebrates the creativity and communities that have shaped the legacy of both brands.","image":{"file":{"uid":"blt851721fa30abe2a9","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-10-22T10:12:49.039Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"4248631","filename":"The_LEGO_Group_\u0026_DAFT_PUNK_HERO_Still_3_16x9.png","parent_uid":"blt54bc8afafc0775e9","tags":[],"title":"The LEGO Group \u0026 DAFT PUNK_HERO Still 3_16x9.png","updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:12:49.039Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-22T12:43:22.238Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt851721fa30abe2a9/The_LEGO_Group_\u0026_DAFT_PUNK_HERO_Still_3_16x9.png"},"alt":"LEGO Daft Punk Minifigures"}},"media_assets":[],"page_headline":"Builders After All: The LEGO Group and DAFT PUNK™ announce partnership – blending worlds of music, culture and creative experimentation","related_articles":[],"release_date":"2026-10-22T14:00:00.000Z","seo_description":"LEGO Group and DAFT PUNK™ announce new partnership inspire remix fandoms Daft Punk robots LEGO product content brand collaboration creativity communities legacy","show_social_sharing":true,"spotlight":true,"tags":[],"title":"The LEGO Group and DAFT PUNK Partnership Announcement","updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:03:35.006Z","updated_by":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","url":"/news/2026/october/lego-group-and-daft-punk-partnership-announcement","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-27T10:03:38.764Z","user":"bltb01e6f038ac0b8f9","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"blt16985475014bdd81","locale":"en-us","_version":6,"ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"asset_bundle":{"uid":"blt03649fabae74e10f","_version":1,"parent_uid":"blta207b4b535e16a01","title":"OneDrive_2026-10-15.zip","created_by":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","updated_by":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","created_at":"2026-10-15T13:37:03.569Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:37:03.569Z","content_type":"application/zip","file_size":"251968701","filename":"OneDrive_2026-10-15.zip","ACL":{},"is_dir":false,"tags":[],"publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-15T13:38:51.901Z","user":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt03649fabae74e10f/OneDrive_2026-10-15.zip"},"author":"","categories":[{"uid":"blt239af1885dbcd645","title":"Products","tags":[],"locale":"en-us","created_by":"blt03df1cfe4451465a","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","created_at":"2019-05-27T10:35:55.907Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:52.202Z","ACL":{},"_version":7,"display_title":"Products","category_color":"#8952ba","_in_progress":false,"special_category":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:11:46.412Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"bltfc4d64d99f5a2fe3","_version":4,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"category_color":"#00a3da","created_at":"2024-11-07T13:15:50.881Z","created_by":"blt95f972fd032911c0","display_title":"Press Releases","special_category":true,"tags":[],"title":"Press Releases","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:32.213Z","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","publish_details":{"time":"2025-12-19T13:04:40.633Z","user":"blt95f972fd032911c0","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}}],"components":[{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csd011380dad251a5f"},"text":"","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"bltaae7f49ee3511825","_version":1,"parent_uid":"blta207b4b535e16a01","title":"11388_Lifestyle_Envr_03.jpg","created_by":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","updated_by":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","created_at":"2026-10-15T13:33:03.642Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:33:03.642Z","content_type":"image/jpeg","file_size":"20460251","filename":"11388_Lifestyle_Envr_03.jpg","ACL":{},"is_dir":false,"tags":[],"publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-15T13:35:08.773Z","user":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltaae7f49ee3511825/11388_Lifestyle_Envr_03.jpg"},"alt":"Lifestyle Image"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs7de477cc74d2ad7e"},"text":" - Brand-new LEGO set is a 5,682-piece love letter to Venice and its surrounding neighbourhoods, celebrating the architecture and culture of one of the world's most iconic cities \n - Packed with rich details, from a villa and artisan glassblowing workshop to an astronomical clock tower, gondola and a street piano that plays real notes \n - Includes 17 Minifigures: gondoliers, musicians, tourists and carnival-goers in elaborate masks and costumes \n - Available for LEGO Insiders Early Access from 1 November 2026 from [LEGO.com/Venice][1] and LEGO Stores\n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-gb/product/venetian-neighborhood-11388","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"csac592c0a90d41a03"},"text":"**BILLUND, DENMARK, 15 OCTOBER 2026:** Venice’s iconic canals and centuries-old character are being celebrated today as the LEGO® Icons Venetian Neighbourhood (11388) set is revealed. With 5,682 pieces, this is one of the most intricate city dioramas in the LEGO Icons collection and marks the first time the LEGO Group has created a cityscape-style display model of this scale, inviting builders to capture the romance, rhythm and remarkable architecture of Venice with LEGO elements – no passport required. \n\nSet along a bustling, brick-built waterfront, this set recreates a canal-side neighbourhood embodying the true spirit of the floating city. A luxury villa, artisan glassblowing workshop and astronomical clock tower line the water’s edge while an arched bridge crosses the canal below, where a gondola can glide through the scene. The diorama can be separated and rearranged into two distinct sections, or the roofs and floors lifted away to discover detailed interiors within each building. \n\nWith its richly layered architecture and display-ready silhouette, the model offers LEGO Icons collectors an ambitious new centrepiece build. The set is designed with playful, hands-on features that capture the enchanting atmosphere of the beloved city. Turn the small flower vase atop the street piano to play real notes or rotate the knob on the side of the clock tower to bring its astronomical calendar into motion. \n\nThe neighbourhood is also home to 17 Minifigures, bringing every corner of the storied scene to life.  Gondoliers, musicians, tourists and two carnival-goers dressed in extravagant costumes and elaborate masks make up a delightful tribute to the traditions and festivities that the region is famed for.  \n\nThe LEGO Icons Venetian Neighbourhood (11388) set will be available for [LEGO Insiders][1]* Early Access from 1 November 2026, and for all from 4 November 2026, priced at £449.99 / €499.99 / $549.99. Discover more and purchase at LEGO.com/Venice or visit your nearest LEGO Store. \n\nAdditionally, shoppers who purchase the set (11388) between 1 – 8 November will receive the LEGO Icons Venetian Water Taxi (40898) as a gift with purchase, available while stocks last**. \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-gb/insiders","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"Notes to Editor","_metadata":{"uid":"cs94c517d28c1bdc6c"},"text":"*LEGO Insiders membership required. T\u0026Cs apply. \n**T\u0026Cs apply. \n\n**Product Information \nLEGO® Icons Venetian Neighbourhood (11388)** \n - Age: 18+ \n - RRP:  £449.99 GBP / €499.99 EUR / $549.99 USD \n - Product Number: 11388 \n - Pieces: 5682 \n - Dimensions: Measures over 19 in. (48 cm) high, 25 in. (64 cm) wide and 13 in. (33 cm) deep \n - Available: Via LEGO Stores and [LEGO.com/Venice][1] \n - LEGO Insiders Early Access: 1 November 2026 \n - For all: 4 November 2026\n\n**Gift with Purchase** \n**LEGO® Icons Venetian Water Taxi (40898)** \n - Age: 18+ \n - Product number: 40898 \n - Pieces: 322 \n - Dates: 1-8 November 2026 \n - Minimum purchase: Shoppers will receive this gift when purchasing the new LEGO® Icons Venetian Neighbourhood (11388) set, while stocks last. \n - Key features and functions: Bring a touch of Venice to your home or office with this LEGO® Icons Venetian Water Taxi (40898) décor building set for adults and travel lovers. This fun set features a classic water taxi and a dock setting, plus captain and tourist Minifigures, accessories and 2 pigeon figures for storytelling.\n\n**About the LEGO Group** \nThe LEGO Group’s mission is to inspire and develop the builders of tomorrow through the power of play. The LEGO System in Play, with its foundation in LEGO bricks, allows children and fans to build and rebuild anything they can imagine. \n\nThe LEGO Group was founded in Billund, Denmark in 1932 by Ole Kirk Kristiansen, its name derived from the two Danish words LEg GOdt, which mean “Play Well”. \n\nToday, the LEGO Group remains a family-owned company headquartered in Billund. Its products are sold in more than 120 countries worldwide. For more information: www.LEGO.com. \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-gb/product/venetian-neighborhood-11388","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}}],"created_at":"2026-10-15T13:31:28.767Z","created_by":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","manchet":{"title":"Ciao, Venice: The LEGO Group floats new Icons set ","text":"The LEGO Group reveals the LEGO® Icons Venetian Neighbourhood (11388) set. With 5,682 pieces, this is one of the most intricate city dioramas in the LEGO Icons collection and marks the first time the LEGO Group has created a cityscape-style display model of this scale, inviting builders to capture the romance, rhythm and remarkable architecture of Venice with LEGO elements – no passport required.","image":{"file":{"uid":"blt0ab039699f8ba2d5","_version":1,"parent_uid":"blta207b4b535e16a01","title":"11388_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg","created_by":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","updated_by":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","created_at":"2026-10-15T13:32:47.240Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:32:47.240Z","content_type":"image/jpeg","file_size":"19519713","filename":"11388_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg","ACL":{},"is_dir":false,"tags":[],"publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-15T13:35:06.133Z","user":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt0ab039699f8ba2d5/11388_Lifestyle_Cons_02.jpg"},"alt":"Product Image"}},"media_assets":[],"page_headline":"Ciao, Venice: The LEGO Group floats new Icons set ","related_articles":[],"release_date":"2026-10-15T13:27:14.000Z","seo_description":"Ciao, Venice: The LEGO Group floats new Icons set ","show_social_sharing":true,"spotlight":false,"tags":[],"title":"Ciao, Venice: The LEGO Group floats new Icons set","updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:38:37.176Z","updated_by":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","url":"/news/2026/october/ciao-venice-the-lego-group-floats-new-icons-set","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-15T13:38:48.400Z","user":"bltc0f75bb6f63ef9d4","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"blt190ae90ec74007f9","_version":8,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"asset_bundle":null,"author":"","categories":[{"uid":"bltfc4d64d99f5a2fe3","_version":4,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"category_color":"#00a3da","created_at":"2024-11-07T13:15:50.881Z","created_by":"blt95f972fd032911c0","display_title":"Press Releases","special_category":true,"tags":[],"title":"Press Releases","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:32.213Z","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","publish_details":{"time":"2025-12-19T13:04:40.633Z","user":"blt95f972fd032911c0","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"blt2cc3f649a24e9f41","title":"Marvel","display_title":"Marvel","category_color":"#E3599D","special_category":true,"tags":[],"locale":"en-us","created_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","created_at":"2025-01-30T08:30:09.709Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T13:02:30.706Z","ACL":{},"_version":2,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:17:20.543Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"blt8ee4cddab6a06bb4","title":"Star Wars","display_title":"Star Wars","category_color":"#E3599D","special_category":true,"tags":[],"locale":"en-us","created_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","created_at":"2025-01-30T08:32:45.904Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T13:00:16.046Z","ACL":{},"_version":2,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:18:40.540Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}}],"components":[{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs55845fcc4b1334a1"},"text":"","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt53edd234b8b11de1","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-10-08T16:10:47.127Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"2531911","filename":"Cocktail_Hero_Image.png","parent_uid":"blt730402a0c8a5a799","tags":[],"title":"Cocktail Hero Image.png","updated_at":"2026-10-08T16:10:47.127Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-08T16:10:58.723Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt53edd234b8b11de1/Cocktail_Hero_Image.png"},"alt":"LEGO Star Wars Marvel Hero Asset"},"video_id":"","video":"","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs09fafc1535deaea3"},"text":" - New LEGO Ideas® challenge invites fans to create a first-of-its-kind cross-universe moment in LEGO bricks to celebrate iconic storytelling worlds of Star Wars™ and Marvel. \n - The announcement was made at New York Comic Con during a panel featuring Kevin Smith; actor, director and Marvel Comics writer.  \n - Now open, fans can choose from three building themes – vehicles, characters, or scenes – to inspire the Star Wars and Marvel mash-up and submit via the LEGO Ideas platform.\n\n**NEW YORK, OCTOBER 10, 2026:** Today at New York Comic Con (NYCC), the LEGO Group announced a first-of-its-kind LEGO® Ideas challenge. For the first time ever, fans are invited to mash-up *Star Wars*™ and Marvel by reimagining characters, vehicles and scenes from the two universes in LEGO form.  \n\nWhat’s more, the LEGO Ideas platform means that once the build has been submitted and fans have voted on the design, the favourite submissions will then become immortalised as an official LEGO product. \n\n**Fede Begher, Senior Vice President and Head of Product Group at the LEGO Group,** said: “*This challenge is a milestone for LEGO Ideas and our fan community. For the first time ever, fans can build with both Marvel and* Star Wars *in a single LEGO Ideas challenge, unlocking entirely new possibilities for creativity and storytelling. We know our fans never stop imagining new ways to bring their favourite worlds together, and we're excited to see the originality, passion and innovation they bring to this unique crossover.*” \n\nAs a tribute to the landmark 50th anniversary of the *Star Wars* franchise in 2027, the *Star Wars*/Marvel: Hope Assembles comic series was unveiled this past summer. Launching in January, it’s the first-ever crossover between the *Star Wars* and Marvel Comics universes. The LEGO Ideas challenge celebrates that crossover and honours the 50th anniversary. \n\nOpen from today, fans simply need to visit [ideas.lego.com][1], choose from three challenge themes of mashing up *Star Wars* and Marvel vehicles, characters or scenes, review all challenge rules and guidelines, and then get building with LEGO elements. Voting for the submissions begins December 15, 2026, with the Grand Prize Selections being announced next year. \n\n \n\nFor more information, please visit [ideas.lego.com/campaigns/hope-assembles][2]. \n\n\n  [1]: https://ideas.lego.com/\n  [2]: https://ideas.lego.com/campaigns/hope-assembles","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"Notes to editor","_metadata":{"uid":"csad069b29f86c0ab9"},"text":"For more information, please contact [media@LEGO.com][1]. \n\n**About the LEGO Group** \nThe LEGO Group’s mission is to inspire and develop the builders of tomorrow through the power of play. The LEGO System in Play, with its foundation in LEGO bricks, allows children and fans to build and rebuild anything they can imagine. \n\nThe LEGO Group was founded in Billund, Denmark in 1932 by Ole Kirk Kristiansen, its name derived from the two Danish words LEg GOdt, which mean “Play Well”. \n\nToday, the LEGO Group remains a family-owned company headquartered in Billund. Its products are now sold in more than 120 countries worldwide.  \n\nFor more information: [www.LEGO.com][2] \n\n**About the LEGO Ideas platform** \nLEGO Ideas offers fans the opportunity to submit their own brick creations with the chance to have their concept brought to life with the help of LEGO master designers and a share of the profits. Find out more at [ideas.LEGO.com][3]. \n\nSTAR WARS and related properties are trademarks and/or copyrights, in the United States and other countries, of Lucasfilm Ltd. and/or its affiliates. © \u0026 TM Lucasfilm Ltd. \n\n \n\n© 2026 MARVEL \n\n\n  [1]: mailto:media@LEGO.com\n  [2]: http://www.LEGO.com\n  [3]: https://ideas.lego.com/","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}}],"created_at":"2026-10-10T22:24:26.391Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","manchet":{"title":"The LEGO Group invites fans to mash-up STAR WARS™ and MARVEL universes for the first time ever in LEGO Ideas® challenge","text":"The LEGO Group announced a first-of-its-kind LEGO® Ideas challenge. For the first time ever, fans are invited to mash-up Star Wars™ and Marvel by reimagining characters, vehicles and scenes from the two universes in LEGO form.  ","image":{"file":{"uid":"blt53edd234b8b11de1","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/png","created_at":"2026-10-08T16:10:47.127Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"2531911","filename":"Cocktail_Hero_Image.png","parent_uid":"blt730402a0c8a5a799","tags":[],"title":"Cocktail Hero Image.png","updated_at":"2026-10-08T16:10:47.127Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-08T16:10:58.723Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt53edd234b8b11de1/Cocktail_Hero_Image.png"},"alt":"LEGO Star Wars Marvel Hero Asset"}},"media_assets":[],"page_headline":"The LEGO Group invites fans to mash-up STAR WARS™ and MARVEL universes for the first time ever in LEGO Ideas® challenge","related_articles":[],"release_date":"2026-10-10T22:19:39.000Z","seo_description":"The LEGO Group invites fans to mash-up STAR WARS™ and MARVEL universes for the first time ever in LEGO Ideas challenge","show_social_sharing":true,"spotlight":false,"tags":[],"title":"LEGO Ideas Marvel Star Wars","updated_at":"2026-10-12T16:46:06.039Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","url":"/news/2026/october/lego-ideas-marvel-star-wars","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-12T16:46:16.588Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"blt11af4685f412b17a","locale":"en-us","_version":13,"ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"asset_bundle":{"uid":"blta6122969d0d2c117","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"application/zip","created_at":"2026-10-09T12:26:26.335Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"756917262","filename":"LEGO_Friends_Musical_Trailer_Media_Asset_Toolkit.zip","parent_uid":"blt2be6c9fb16bd3d4a","tags":[],"title":"LEGO Friends Musical Trailer_Media Asset Toolkit.zip","updated_at":"2026-10-09T12:26:26.335Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-09T12:26:42.125Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blta6122969d0d2c117/LEGO_Friends_Musical_Trailer_Media_Asset_Toolkit.zip"},"author":"","categories":[{"uid":"blt1dd946dbb217c9f8","title":"Friends","display_title":"Friends","category_color":"#E3599D","special_category":true,"tags":[],"locale":"en-us","created_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","created_at":"2025-01-30T08:27:49.312Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T13:04:18.918Z","ACL":{},"_version":2,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":{"time":"2025-02-17T10:15:56.158Z","user":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}},{"uid":"bltfc4d64d99f5a2fe3","_version":4,"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"category_color":"#00a3da","created_at":"2024-11-07T13:15:50.881Z","created_by":"blt95f972fd032911c0","display_title":"Press Releases","special_category":true,"tags":[],"title":"Press Releases","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:13:32.213Z","updated_by":"blt6596ebe8f7768176","publish_details":{"time":"2025-12-19T13:04:40.633Z","user":"blt95f972fd032911c0","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}}],"components":[{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs5c12a473a64908c1"},"text":" - Trailer drops for LEGO Friends®: Heartlake The Musical live-action special with the full version premiering on October 16th  \n - Representing the next evolution of LEGO Friends entertainment, LEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical is the first-ever live-action adaptation of the beloved LEGO Friends world. \n - Executive produced by acclaimed filmmaker Kenny Ortega, Jill Wilfert of LEGO Entertainment, and Michael McKenna and Hanah Draper of Final Pixel, the musical follows protagonist Daisy on a music-filled adventure through Heartlake City, featuring four original songs, spectacular performances and dynamic choreography. \n - A LEGO set, turned Musical setting, turned live-experience pop-up: The LEGO Friends Unicorn café set come to life in three ways, fans can join the pop-up experience in London from October 29-31st \n - Fans are invited to step inside the café and experience hands-on building as well as an immersive screening of the musical","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"f4215817-9294-46ee-8b42-c233c4255f9c","video":"","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cse9ec8e5855f6d504"},"text":"**BILLUND, DENMARK, 09 OCTOBER 2026:** Today, the LEGO Group released the trailer for LEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical, its first-ever LEGO Friends-inspired live-action special. The full special premieres on 16 October on the LEGO Group’s YouTube channel. \n\nFollowing its premiere on the LEGO YouTube channel on 16 October, LEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical will reach audiences globally through a network of broadcast and streaming partners, including Netflix, Peacock, Tubi, RTL and AMC Networks in select markets. \n\nLEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical explores the LEGO Friends universe in a 50-minute adventure that follows Daisy (played by Jada Langley), a bright and creative teenager navigating a big move and her sense of belonging. \n\nExecutive produced by acclaimed director Kenny Ortega, produced by Final Pixel, and directed and choreographed by renowned filmmaker Paul Becker, LEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical celebrates the power of friendship, creativity and self-expression through an uplifting story filled with music, heart and adventure. \n\nFeaturing four original songs written exclusively for the musical, the special brings beloved LEGO Friends characters from brick to screen for the first time in a live-action adaptation. Spectacular performances, dynamic choreography and cutting-edge virtual production technology from Final Pixel transform Heartlake City into a vibrant live-action world inspired by the stories, characters and locations fans know and love. \n\nSince launching in 2012, LEGO Friends has grown into one of the LEGO Group's most beloved home-grown franchises, extending beyond physical play through animated series, digital content, books and experiences that have connected with audiences around the world. With LEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical, the LEGO Group is continuing to expand the LEGO Friends universe, bringing the world of Heartlake City to life through its first-ever live-action production.  ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt90d0416bd1abbbaa","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-10-09T11:53:15.423Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"484906","filename":"Friends_HeartlakeTheMusical_2026_SPCL_ENG_PressStill004.jpg","parent_uid":"blt2be6c9fb16bd3d4a","tags":[],"title":"Friends_HeartlakeTheMusical_2026_SPCL_ENG_PressStill004.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-09T11:53:15.423Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-09T12:26:46.480Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt90d0416bd1abbbaa/Friends_HeartlakeTheMusical_2026_SPCL_ENG_PressStill004.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO® Friends: Heartlake The Musical Trailer Stills"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cseeea73cee3f51e55"},"text":"Speaking about the experience, **executive producer Kenny Ortega** said: \"*As a lifelong believer in the power of music and storytelling, this project has been a joy to be part of. Together with my long-time creative partner Paul Becker, and the talented innovators at Final Pixel, we've built a world that feels full of wonder, heart and possibility. What I love most is that beneath all the spectacle, Heartlake The Musical is a story about finding your people, embracing who you are and discovering that you can achieve incredible things when you support one another. Which is true to the LEGO Friends universe!*\"  ","buttons":[],"image":{"file":{"uid":"blt52993bfa4ace3991","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-10-09T11:53:15.798Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"4054812","filename":"Friends_HeartlakeTheMusical_2026_SPCL_ENG_PressStill020.jpg","parent_uid":"blt2be6c9fb16bd3d4a","tags":[],"title":"Friends_HeartlakeTheMusical_2026_SPCL_ENG_PressStill020.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-09T11:53:15.798Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-09T12:26:44.839Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt52993bfa4ace3991/Friends_HeartlakeTheMusical_2026_SPCL_ENG_PressStill020.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO® Friends: Heartlake The Musical Trailer Stills"},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":true,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"","_metadata":{"uid":"cs5a76a47ba5b43a4d"},"text":"\"*Creating our first-live-action musical is a major milestone for LEGO Friends and an exciting evolution of the storytelling experiences we can bring to our fans,*\" said **Jill Wilfert, SVP, Global Entertainment Partners \u0026 Content at the LEGO Group**. “*At its heart, Heartlake The Musical celebrates the power of imagination. Alongside the original music and spectacular performances, it brings the creativity inherent in the LEGO brand to life, showing girls that they can build far more than models, they can build stories, friendships, possibilities and positive change.*”\n\n**From the brick, to the screen and beyond, enter the world of LEGO Friends at the Unicorn Café** \nFrom 29-31 October, fans can step into a life-sized Unicorn Café and experience a LEGO Friends set brought to life, located at Potters Field Park, in London. The pop-up experience is also inspired by one of the musical's most magical locations, so fans can experience the digital, physical, and life-size Unicorn Café all at once. \n\nVisitors can enjoy fun interactive spaces inspired by the LEGO Friends universe, as well as Heartlake The Musical. They will be able to attend exclusive musical screenings, get hands-on with LEGO Friends building challenges, create their own take-home builds, shareable photo moments, and explore themed spaces, inspired by beloved Heartlake City locations.  \n\nWhether singing along to songs from the musical, unleashing their creativity through play or spending time with family and friends, the Unicorn Café will be an unforgettable LEGO Friends experience for fans of all ages. \n\nFor more information about LEGO® Friends and the Unicorn Café experience, please [visit][1]. \n\nFans around the world will be able to celebrate LEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical through a series of screenings, media events and LEGO Friends experiences taking place across Canada, the Czech Republic, Poland, Mexico, the UK, Netherlands, Türkiye and the USA. \n\n**Watch the trailer for LEGO Friends: Heartlake City the Musical [here][2] and don’t miss the full premiere on 16 October. Stay tuned to the [LEGO YouTube channel][3] and discover a world of friendship, creativity and imagination brought to life.** \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/en-gb/themes/friends/about\n  [2]: https://www.youtube.com/user/LEGO\n  [3]: https://www.youtube.com/user/LEGO","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}},{"content_block":{"title":"Notes for editors","_metadata":{"uid":"cs10594f3070ba72be"},"text":"**Title**  \n - LEGO Friends: Heartlake the Musical\n\n**Category**  \n - Musical, Comedy\n\n**Produced by** \n - Final Pixel\n\n**Director**\n - Paul Becker\n\n**Choreographer**\n - Paul Becker \n - Ryan Maw\n\n**Writers**  \n - Kirk R. Thatcher  \n - Jeremy Adams\n\n**Story by** \n - Kenny Ortega\n\n**Executive Producers** \n - Kenny Ortega  \n - Jill Wilfert  \n - Hannah Brinkman  \n - Robert Fewkes  \n - Vicky Kjær Jensen \n - Hanah Draper  \n - Michael McKenna  \n - Keith Malone  \n - Ryan Christians\n\n**Co-Executive Producer** \n - Paul Becker\n\n**Full cast list** \n - Jada Langley as Daisy   \n - Gino Ochello as Leo   \n - Gracie McGonigal as Autumn   \n - Hannah Gracie as Paisley   \n - Danita Walcott-Nicholls as Aliya   \n - Hamish Skeoch as Olly   \n - Manuel Jenoure as Zac   \n - Angelina Li as Liann   \n - Darcy Jacobs as Candi   \n - Meesha Garbett as Nova   \n - Siubhan Harrison as Daisy's Mom   \n - Kevin N Golding as Old Man Heart   \n - Taylor Sullivan as Kyle   \n - Ian Virgo as Daisy's Dad (\"The Brickologist\")   \n - Pickle the Dog as Himself\n\n**Original Music**  \nComposed and written by James Taylor, Heartlake: The Musical brings four original songs to all LEGO and LEGO Friends fans.   \n\n - “**Better Dancing Alone**” – Daisy, our protagonist, sings an emotional song about the freedom she feels creating with LEGO bricks. This ultimately brings her to Heartlake City, the vibrant, whimsical world she built herself.\n\n\u003c!-- --\u003e\n\n - Written by: Paul Becker, George Kostouros \u0026 Brandt Parks\n\n\u003c!-- --\u003e\n\n - Produced by: James A. Taylor, George Kostouros, Brandt Parks \u0026 Paul Becker\n\n \n\n - “**Heartlake Glow**” – The LEGO Friends cast sings and dances to this catchy tune at The Unicorn Cafe as they explain to Daisy the legend of Old Man Heart, and why they are fighting to save the Tree House.\n\n\u003c!-- --\u003e\n\n - Written by: Alex Marshall\n\n\u003c!-- --\u003e\n\n - Produced by: James A. Taylor \u0026 Alex Marshall\n\n \n\n - “**Why Waste a Wish**”- In this ballad, Daisy and Leo take a boat ride around Heartlake City as they sing about the heart of the musical and their special bond of friendship.\n\n\u003c!-- --\u003e\n\n - Written by: Charlie Watson \n - Orchestrated by: Ben Morales Frost \n - Produced by: James A. Taylor \u0026 Charlie Watson\n\n \n\n - “**Chase the Stars**” – In this uplifting dance anthem, Daisy and Paisley come together to sing a powerful duet as the LEGO Friends crew rally to save the Tree House from being torn down.\n\n\u003c!-- --\u003e\n\n - Written by: Charlie Watson \u0026 George Kostouros \n - Produced by: James A. Taylor, Charlie Watson \u0026 George Kostouros\n\n \n\n**Local market activations:** \n**Experience LEGO® Friends: Heartlake The Musical screenings in:** \n - Canada: Premiere screening at TIFF Lightbox, Toronto (16 October) \n - Czech Republic: Press and influencer screening featuring local talent (16 October) \n - Poland: Consumer cinema screening (early November) \n - Mexico: Special screening experience at Papalote Museo del Niño, Mexico City (17-18 October) \n - Türkiye: Influencer and consumer screenings\n\n**Experience LEGO® Friends-inspired pop-up events and activations in:** \n - London, UK: LEGO Friends Unicorn Café (28-31 October) \n - The Netherlands: Unicorn Café experience at LEGO World \n - Türkiye: Heartlake Café activation at Piazza Mall Istanbul (10-18 October) \n - Mexico: Unicorn Café experience at Papalote Museo del Niño \n - USA: LEGO Friends Unicorn Café-inspired micro-events series\n\n \n\n**About the LEGO Group**  \nThe LEGO Group’s mission is to inspire and develop the builders of tomorrow through the power of play. The LEGO System in Play, with its foundation in LEGO bricks, allows children and fans to build and rebuild anything they can imagine.  \n\nThe LEGO Group was founded in Billund, Denmark in 1932 by Ole Kirk Kristiansen, its name derived from the two Danish words LEg GOdt, which mean “Play Well”. Today, the LEGO Group remains a family-owned company headquartered in Billund. However, its products are now sold in more than 120 countries worldwide.  \n\nFor more news from the LEGO Group, information about our financial performance and responsibility engagement, please visit [www.LEGO.com/aboutus][1].  \n\n**About Final Pixel** \nFinal Pixel is a next-generation entertainment studio, led by established showrunners and filmmakers Michael McKenna and Hanah Draper, blending boundless imagination and world-class artistry with pioneering real-time live animation production technology.  Final Pixel brings brand storyworlds to life across film, television, games, and live events. For more information, please visit [https://www.finalpixel.com/][2]. \n\n\n  [1]: https://www.lego.com/aboutus\n  [2]: https://www.finalpixel.com/","buttons":[],"image":{"file":null,"alt":""},"video_id":"","video":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","config":{"make_lead":false,"zoomable_img":false,"obj_align":"Under text","btn_small":false,"btn_link":true},"css_class":""}}],"created_at":"2026-10-08T19:58:11.921Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","manchet":{"title":"LEGO Group released the trailer for LEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical, its first-ever LEGO Friends-inspired live-action special YouTube","text":"The LEGO Group released the trailer for LEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical, its first-ever LEGO Friends-inspired live-action special. The full special premieres on 16 October on the LEGO Group’s YouTube channel.","image":{"file":{"uid":"blt5b96d15a9e3d58b7","_version":1,"is_dir":false,"ACL":{},"content_type":"image/jpeg","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:56:29.984Z","created_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","file_size":"38722436","filename":"Friends_HeartlakeTheMusical_2026_SPCL_Poster_Horizontal_V2.jpg","parent_uid":"blt2be6c9fb16bd3d4a","tags":[],"title":"Friends_HeartlakeTheMusical_2026_SPCL_Poster_Horizontal_V2.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-08T19:56:29.984Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-09T12:26:48.065Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/blt5b96d15a9e3d58b7/Friends_HeartlakeTheMusical_2026_SPCL_Poster_Horizontal_V2.jpg"},"alt":"LEGO Friends Music Poster"}},"media_assets":[],"page_headline":"The LEGO Group unveils trailer for the first ever live-action LEGO® Friends: Heartlake The Musical ","related_articles":["blta5b553eac02ee801"],"release_date":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","seo_description":"LEGO Group released the trailer for LEGO Friends: Heartlake The Musical, its first-ever LEGO Friends-inspired live-action special YouTube","show_social_sharing":true,"spotlight":false,"tags":[],"title":"LEGO® Friends: Heartlake The Musical Trailer","updated_at":"2026-10-09T12:27:01.523Z","updated_by":"blt469c9360c3b25492","url":"/news/2026/october/lego-friends-heartlake-the-musical-trailer","publish_details":{"time":"2026-10-09T14:00:01.244Z","user":"blt469c9360c3b25492","environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us"}}],"totalCount":312},"texts":{"texts":{"aria_texts":{"close_modal":"Close dialog window","breadcrumb":"Breadcrumb","toggle_page_navigation":"Toggle Site Navigation","site_navigation":"Site navigation","page_navigation":"Page navigation","zoom":"Zoom","toggle_page_sub_navigation":"Toggle Sub Navigation"},"news":{"related":"Related articles","load_more":"Load more","assets":{"see_all":"See all assets","download_all":"Download all assets","download":"Download this asset","pdf_placeholder_img":{"uid":"bltcb30ec711eb95f11","created_by":"blt014627571d605065","updated_by":"blt014627571d605065","created_at":"2019-08-20T11:15:25.462Z","updated_at":"2019-08-20T11:16:39.683Z","content_type":"image/png","file_size":"7058","filename":"pdf.png","title":"pdf.png","ACL":{},"_version":2,"is_dir":false,"tags":[],"parent_uid":"blt2dbfa302d3950fa4","description":"Placeholder image showing a file icon for PDF documents","publish_details":{"environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us","time":"2019-09-11T07:34:24.869Z","user":"blt651ddbb99bcad793"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltcb30ec711eb95f11/pdf.png"}}},"site_name":"About Us","social_sharing":{"facebook":"Share on Facebook","twitter":"Share on Twitter","linkedin":"Share on LinkedIn"},"title":"About us texts"},"frontendTexts":{"common":{"load_more":"Load more","next":"Next","previous":"Previous"},"media":{"back":"Back to Media Library","download":"Download {filename}","placeholder_image":{"uid":"bltcb30ec711eb95f11","created_by":"blt014627571d605065","updated_by":"blt014627571d605065","created_at":"2019-08-20T11:15:25.462Z","updated_at":"2019-08-20T11:16:39.683Z","content_type":"image/png","file_size":"7058","filename":"pdf.png","title":"pdf.png","ACL":{},"_version":2,"is_dir":false,"tags":[],"parent_uid":"blt2dbfa302d3950fa4","description":"Placeholder image showing a file icon for PDF documents","publish_details":{"environment":"bltbded07edec5cb5b8","locale":"en-us","time":"2019-09-11T07:34:24.869Z","user":"blt651ddbb99bcad793"},"url":"https://www.lego.com/cdn/cs/aboutus/assets/bltcb30ec711eb95f11/pdf.png"}},"newsroom":{"s